{"doc_id": "doc5979", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Lula is an African-American woman with a dislike for white people. She doesn't like the idea of Calpurnia bringing Atticus Finch's children, Jem and Scout, with her to church and tells her so but is overruled by the other congregants. According to James Zeebo, Calpurnia's son, Lula's said to be, \"a troublemaker from way back, with fancy ideas and haughty ways.\" She's threatened with being \"churched\" (subjected to church discipline) by Reverend Sykes.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 2012575646, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "a10143cb3f97373660ae402edb7652d22036e42c7863ed0805da54b88b060b0d", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Zeebo", "matched_aliases": ["Zeebo", "James Zeebo"], "query_id": "test163", "question_hash": "9a1367c4c1f53849dcb5602716c5dfb71cabd5190d55e67daf4fb50959b0cc93", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4705135a790dd7d9cf7067391af57f4447c99ee629439aa50243adeb49cdbcf5", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2074900168, "similarity": 0.6689497716894978, "source_content_hash": "ddd11eabd4b196c25120ecf757233a59bf246012a87d6834ee9334e51eccedc1", "source_hash": "718fd40bf0f36d354ca30d2744abc74b2ee9b5a9ffe9928bf1e0a700ad941306", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a35dd3b19f7dcf2e7ff4c6ceb09891c7aaae1da4ab74ad8c5e8a1212f31a27d1", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc5995", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Zeebo is Calpurnia's eldest son. He is one of just four people in First Purchase Church who can read, so he is the vocal leader, leading hymns in the Negro First Purchase Church by \"lining,\" reading a line of verse and having the congregation repeat it. Calpurnia taught Zeebo how to read. He is also the garbage man of Maycomb, and took away the dead rabid dog, Tim Johnson. When a fellow church member, a woman named Lula, tries to make the children feel bad for attending church with his mother, Zeebo welcomes Scout and Jem with open arms. He is kind but very quiet.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 67822047, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "5dd3d06a1d520c10baf0d19bd625c71d436f71c051ac93eaab729b91b17c6860", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Zeebo", "matched_aliases": ["Zeebo"], "query_id": "test163", "question_hash": "9a1367c4c1f53849dcb5602716c5dfb71cabd5190d55e67daf4fb50959b0cc93", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "34feca6387bd9b951a16f26d7c6f53e1c155e26a67a43c3a9ebd8114e70e35ed", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1512420161, "similarity": 0.022562449637389202, "source_content_hash": "f7af9fe779167bce9b9a0ce4cd4b6730e166df11264e7196dcf63c95f89f17a9", "source_hash": "98b5c18ec2ad3c561306518139ba36fb63989022f474fe56886bde056ad26010", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "614453912d6944313bb6931ee9bedcd35f6fb4a3b724ddd2593395fa88b3c905", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc5996", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 2017 American League Championship Series was a best-of-seven playoff pitting the Houston Astros against the New York Yankees for the American League pennant and the right to face the Los Angeles Dodgers in the 2017 World Series. The Astros defeated the Yankees in 7 games after falling behind 3 games to 2. The home team won every game in the series.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 2018285199, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "9dca0552a950758be0dc8ad9afa73cf26fceedcbb4396dbe23c07acf10842588", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Houston Astros", "matched_aliases": ["Houston Astros"], "query_id": "test164", "question_hash": "34018c1e5052113dfcf89434d9f8e4520d4c28e56fdd77eefe96850795885ec1", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "56fd17913d9eaa2033ade457542f612dfa8da713ae525b4a4713681e61dd4cad", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 397090706, "similarity": 0.5100917431192661, "source_content_hash": "c64a41aec5fb912893a2e1663c4704ca24bcfd49054b1d28323ffc42df43bd74", "source_hash": "1a501a12c361a4e268a938060fcd9b462740d0d3cce704d631a7ad7e7056c448", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ceed54b04095eea74a1fc98ae318efa86abb87ddfc4bc2653632534e04efcbba", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
