{"doc_id": "doc8420", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Hacksaw Ridge is a 2016 biographical war drama film directed by Mel Gibson and written by Andrew Knight and Robert Schenkkan, based on the 2004 documentary The Conscientious Objector. The film focuses on the World War II experiences of Desmond Doss, an American pacifist combat medic who was a Seventh-day Adventist Christian, refusing to carry or use a firearm or weapons of any kind. Doss became the first conscientious objector to be awarded the Medal of Honor, for service above and beyond the call of duty during the Battle of Okinawa. Andrew Garfield stars as Doss, with Sam Worthington, Luke Bracey, Teresa Palmer, Hugo Weaving, Rachel Griffiths, and Vince Vaughn in supporting roles.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 999404259, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "6c78b597c9a601684133ee48d1ef26f4741cdabcd3724efc5a5b33d5caed1a1b", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Andrew Garfield", "matched_aliases": ["Andrew Garfield"], "query_id": "test231", "question_hash": "c6f67414535b431a156848d15999b4233083b899c4db9a50dad850a994a738d9", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "27537236ef6a479bd6e9176164a48ce74f9b4e8f642d146d00937b6c7e34dfdb", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 208159488, "similarity": 0.06779661016949153, "source_content_hash": "5c2e5c4be1b548ab8f3f18208c0eafca3ee5087632d9014713844498add29c81", "source_hash": "e3a760f7a981f42e7ac48a832dc64d4036677211b3bbcc2ffbee3ff2f57f4dd6", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "0c6f5e2e8164b78cf5c8f1cc2b1aaa3ce4ed2d841657647830be7679121aad23", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc8502", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "\"How Deep Is Your Love\" is a pop ballad and Rap based, written, and recorded by the Bee Gees in 1977 and released as a single in September of that year. It was ultimately used as part of the soundtrack to the film Saturday Night Fever. It was a number three hit in the United Kingdom and Australia. In the United States, it topped the Billboard Hot 100 on 24 December 1977 (becoming the first of six consecutive US number-one hits), ended the 10-week reign of Debby Boone's \"You Light Up My Life\" and stayed in the Top 10 for a then-record 17 weeks. The single spent six weeks atop the US adult contemporary chart. It is listed at number 22 on the 55th anniversary edition of Billboard's All Time Top 100.[1] Alongside \"Stayin' Alive\" and \"Night Fever\", it is one of the group's three tracks on the list. The song was covered by Take That for their 1996 Greatest Hits album, reaching number-one on the UK Singles Chart for three weeks.[2]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1124228085, "similarity": 0.9984017048481619, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "33991373605cecb799b308b3e6ad40d0ccea173d73e2ee621aaf57dd799a57d1", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "1977", "matched_aliases": ["1977"], "query_id": "test235", "question_hash": "439f7149861aef8054f943bc0a5224bf3a1a3bed563d165a8b4de28b7c635701", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "758cab46417154e49afa42113b91325a2c61e14ab5145abca93cbe82b7c4be42", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1437316906, "similarity": 0.52832674571805, "source_content_hash": "b491706bce44dafbca66815458d3f5c65f5cef505641b582c3ca552c0abc1841", "source_hash": "a67eeddb43a09aaf25354898eb00425d89877d42c05fcb2c2f8940dce410c83c", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "4fdf63856bfe612b4a5830b1a4d9c4dac6d6ad616aefa447baad92dfa01e94df", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc8829", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Rust is an iron oxide, a usually red oxide formed by the redox reaction of iron and oxygen in the presence of water or air moisture. Several forms of rust are distinguishable both visually and by spectroscopy, and form under different circumstances. Rust consists of hydrated iron(III) oxides Fe2O3·nH2O and iron(III) oxide-hydroxide (FeO(OH), Fe(OH)3).", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 725814296, "similarity": 0.9943661971830986, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "0c992ba015bb365d433f6b4564abaa837fd0528ff8a6e36e254be3e163180816", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Rust", "matched_aliases": ["Rust"], "query_id": "test239", "question_hash": "f74d8a54e879ac5d4e0f2a09f3819509576f98c7d9c12487143154df310f5a9d", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "7e77e76172d36a95a5582d6acf4019f4f5e7d3e8aca50e349333e2a9493131b0", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1090597686, "similarity": 0.12121212121212122, "source_content_hash": "fac53216c9cbf01df98b982b3075608479cda526fd8a6f9ec3e0ee86cd751f70", "source_hash": "58097b6d3962a74f64b69cd17b5ea68042287b834364d92fa569d7de02206514", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "5e509da75cab79da4d354a86e79b7bfee69cdbf14a81d707c8862a1d4c69e4d9", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
