{"doc_id": "doc15868", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Taylor Michel Momsen (born July 26, 1993) is an American singer, songwriter, former actress and model. She is known for being the lead singer and frontwoman of the American rock band The Pretty Reckless. She is also known for portraying the character of Jenny Humphrey on the CW teen drama series Gossip Girl (2007–2012) and Cindy Lou Who in the film Dr. Seuss' How the Grinch Stole Christmas (2000).", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 375022340, "similarity": 0.9876237623762376, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "6385dd063b5f287f751f8d182b8afb3f3aa94e859d67c6243bdb29ab4f36bd35", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Taylor Michel Momsen", "matched_aliases": ["Taylor Michel Momsen"], "query_id": "test427", "question_hash": "b700f20bd4f4e7fbde935ee37a3e3bf038cca719fce13bc913c56b00ff1c7695", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "977a23a8572f1a6ead354ad0eabcf18e40dcb8b284cb86f9a64105f18231c6c0", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1703498706, "similarity": 0.8372093023255814, "source_content_hash": "79df9d2d9ea1f2c8aa1606417cc82848b2ecf4d3327b1835ba22fca2f9658b8d", "source_hash": "1eaf28078a76723b8a05c23679c7a55c497112704fe791f3e9c5a8edb77bfe93", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "9afc93cf515f88bb0c67d85002f1cb015edf00dd8b89724124ee859722a8a0c0", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc15894", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Turn of the Screw, originally published in 1898, is a novella written by Henry James. The story, a part of gothic and ghost story genres, first appeared in serial format in Collier's Weekly magazine (27 January – 16 April 1898). In October 1898 it appeared in The Two Magics, a book published by Macmillan in New York City and Heinemann in London.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1108040666, "similarity": 0.9943181818181818, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "718c1f3a3c25f31bb44895806938c60f222deed1a4b74570eabe0bba25f5682e", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "1898", "matched_aliases": ["1898"], "query_id": "test429", "question_hash": "c2a4d05b188988b8a40c2ec70cd6db492af5c7d7730cd1f0a2f5244d85422cce", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "dbbf9e8c8d07433c33d9254cb33f52765bcbed228c974f9eb8f5f25daf732971", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1601136534, "similarity": 0.0904836193447738, "source_content_hash": "84b85d0a604c60e446cd1c0a945c798316e2830900286f4ec3280a0dcf53b302", "source_hash": "d884596b17a3a6cdb4110be9598a97f1939be0f331f4e174e1333abd6bda0001", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ea736b644dfc229f8bd7dbfa43865cd2dfa276609b8e1bac701f257a2e55402f", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc15928", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In government, the term authority is often used interchangeably with power. However, their meanings differ: while power is defined as the ability to influence somebody to do something that he/she would not have done, authority refers to a claim of legitimacy, the justification and right to exercise that power. For example, while a mob has the power to punish a criminal, for example by lynching, people who believe in the rule of law consider that only a court of law has the authority to punish a criminal legally as the law says.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 2102232877, "similarity": 0.99812734082397, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "61f1353d041802230f1d1860ba29e67e651ed6ccf350e75c5d0104827bb84bee", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "authority", "matched_aliases": ["authority"], "query_id": "test430", "question_hash": "3fe6037036f714000e2254e7376572682b4ca366aed229c6d41e8125f3d17da5", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "af4ae850cce3af525b67a651eae5673133867f2b0307cabd819bc805fc53d7cc", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 334482050, "similarity": 0.07272727272727272, "source_content_hash": "4553a0f368bd76fd2cdc3ce01c9355d60c5ffcf72d43152add56c1ffa8b373af", "source_hash": "dfc789315efed1d9c8195f0cac51f7850cd0ecb180f7617ae6cfb9af589e3f0f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "49cdb1a9d77d7070ab535752c3045897bcc98662ec4017ed0dc10bab52ae222c", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "valida