{"doc_id": "doc16275", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The government of Japan is a constitutional monarchy in which the power of the Emperor is limited and is relegated primarily to ceremonial duties. As in many other states, the Government is divided into three branches: the Executive branch, the Legislative branch and the Judicial branch.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1516136104, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "7a124eaf1798fb6353caba5d8678a3934ef985fa007e1857c647e20cd2cc4d53", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "constitutional monarchy", "matched_aliases": ["constitutional monarchy"], "query_id": "test440", "question_hash": "e687bd6cb1cf099849bac5b2b44f6c46dd9d1569bd7ac026a08e127a9b8111fb", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "9cbacf6dbd68b4cab9c98e4611ddca4e2f933b9ebfed3fc7d7dcb7d0d82b993b", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1002230743, "similarity": 0.01584786053882726, "source_content_hash": "8ee7854b247c3623fd02f7d924fdc040b004d5835a234e92dcc79ce6dcac9460", "source_hash": "744f5089e05ec075ee1265621e7f759b98547b4e6e8395a3ac9a6228e4442f19", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6e15ee905070937353d0321d08a860b9245220426fcc473eb7a92077c559a25b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc16510", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Historically, no single shot can be cited as the first shot of the battle or the war. Shots were fired earlier at Lexington, Massachusetts where eight Americans were killed and a British soldier was slightly wounded, but accounts of that event are confused and contradictory, and it has been characterized as a massacre rather than a battle.[1] The North Bridge skirmish did see the first shots by Americans acting under orders, the first organized volley by Americans, the first British fatalities, and the first British retreat.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1948760350, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Historical records indicate that while earlier gunfire occurred at Lexington, Massachusetts, the first organized volley of American fire was delivered at the North Bridge. This specific engagement marks the first time Americans acted under orders, resulted in the first British fatalities, and precipitated the first British retreat.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 906460343, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "9e7ccdc7b4539ab57738eca68c365ccb5ab2e388b47152b23ceabfcc553210d1", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Americans acting under orders", "matched_aliases": ["Americans acting under orders"], "query_id": "test443", "question_hash": "72d8372bd8761dcdf3c20f18961ab9c263ac1cbaa3a9a95bf1b060a964f0d2a3", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "be58e6e4bf02eea275361676fedee82fd51fe6a5b20c7658c13dc98f1859ddd1", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1626357528, "similarity": 0.17890520694259013, "source_content_hash": "d6ddbb333191bbf14279ac7fd0e14a7dc97d649245312c482d2b470c0232f9c1", "source_hash": "2f75d7dcc9d4744746ac866f10f47ae42f5b3a7eea0d763d59249798ba958a66", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "8f110f8b4e1d527d24b0aa6af33aae1e4701d229386d6019e2a5d510623a6563", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc16542", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Crowne Plaza is a multinational chain of full service, upscale hotels catering to business travelers and to the meetings and conventions market. It forms part of the InterContinental Hotels Group family of brands, which include InterContinental Hotels & Resorts and Holiday Inn Hotels & Resorts, and operates in 52 countries with more than 400 hotels, usually located in city centers, resorts, coastal towns or near major airports.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1609409937, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "c0ee304eced1847bb3780cee850e370d109a43ef384300a501ae542a5510437d", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "InterContinental Hotels Group", "matched_aliases": ["InterContinental Hotels Group"], "query_id": "test445", "question_hash": "888a1728d7e197b189ec9613062186b47934bf7752a3bc023ee0364da32f0b6d", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "dd2234a35e3dff265278395ce55762a1db0fb167f03a251f75972448c3c72e9a", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 805765993, "similarity": 0.9188571428571428, "source_content_hash": "0b9892777fd2b8e5d5a7625c86102c90cfc057077d06d1080421def0ed6eafa4", "source_hash": "5c890408f312d11f93cc4346fb5ff36f72550f36e05870f52e798dcf55906956", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6c6fbca60ff3d89209bf4154ebccbbe4e2babfa8708fc52c113f913134cf2dc1", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc16785", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In a late finale to his PGA Tour winning career, O'Meara won two majors in 1998, The Masters and the British Open. O'Meara's victory in The Masters came at his 15th attempt. O'Meara attributed this resurgence partly to the inspiration of working with Tiger Woods, the new superstar of the game at the time, with whom O'Meara had become good friends.[5] In the same year, he won the Cisco World Match Play Championship and reached a career best of second in the Official World Golf Ranking.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1268730406, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In a late finale to his PGA Tour winning career, O'Meara won two majors in 1998, The Masters and the British Open. O'Meara's victory in The Masters came at his 15th attempt. O'Meara attributed this resurgence partly to the inspiration of working with Tiger Woods, the new superstar of the game at the time, with whom O'Meara had become good friends.[5] In the same year, he won the Cisco World Match Play Championship and reached a career best of second in the Official World Golf Ranking.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1655417435, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "8267d80eb13bc6f2c31ecfdb5d3dea69f7e2ea5ff5eca00d7e7041803c1088ac", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Mark O'Meara", "matched_aliases": ["Mark O'Meara", "O'Meara"], "query_id": "test455", "question_hash": "7c69b3df0758abe1a7b0ad83f2177254d0f0b97afdb505d4d622dc9dbcb7e1e9", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4b4c4151df2462dff5c7d3c250344ee94f2b9acb22da44734c872ad0d7c304a6", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2057586871, "similarity": 0.13189448441247004, "source_content_hash": "70795bd2bd825be45c8c01bb3b71bc86f1b5e11342a41033bdcbde80b3bf7452", "source_hash": "beac474bdcdd2d6eec1d5