{"doc_id": "doc18264", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 2018 NCAA Division I Men's Basketball Tournament was a 68-team single-elimination tournament to determine the men's National Collegiate Athletic Association (NCAA) Division I college basketball national champion for the 2017–18 season. The 80th edition of the tournament began on March 13, 2018, and concluded with the championship game on April 2 at the Alamodome in San Antonio, Texas.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 638707825, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "189a46101e1e8f7a767c65544f1982bc1a5e8d2f0f0f819ca9980053cb53785e", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "the Alamodome", "matched_aliases": ["the Alamodome"], "query_id": "test495", "question_hash": "f8d358abea49235fcc35c66d4268daa57470618153efc3554be45adf1a31d913", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "17f5ef817687d82975f1f92964d20f2f24285773028a6b63df6f04b2c0017c77", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2105325107, "similarity": 0.4836852207293666, "source_content_hash": "192c703e7ef887a7bedadfee26d701feab72094265a5158d23ddede992657d78", "source_hash": "6c4268bea72a2f7f1c9e6fb2d59bb00293f19d328b60952260c3eb5e29308d5c", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "10bface37429eed9e4fe4ce20a7028ac8a10834158701363d4086f73fc745d48", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc18274", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "For the fourth time, the Alamodome and city of San Antonio are hosting the Final Four. This is the first tournament since 1994 in which no games were played in an NFL stadium, as the Alamodome is a college football stadium, although the Alamodome hosted some home games for the New Orleans Saints during their 2005 season. The 2018 tournament featured three new arenas in previous host cities. Philips Arena, the home of the Atlanta Hawks and replacement for the previously used Omni Coliseum, hosted the South regional games, and the new Little Caesars Arena, home of the Detroit Pistons and Detroit Red Wings, hosted games. And for the first time since 1994, the tournament returned to Wichita and the state of Kansas where Intrust Bank Arena hosted first round games.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 450673972, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "For the fourth time, the Alamodome and city of San Antonio are hosting the Final Four. This is the first tournament since 1994 in which no games were played in an NFL stadium, as the Alamodome is a college football stadium, although the Alamodome hosted some home games for the New Orleans Saints during their 2005 season. The 2018 tournament featured three new arenas in previous host cities. Philips Arena, the home of the Atlanta Hawks and replacement for the previously used Omni Coliseum, hosted the South regional games, and the new Little Caesars Arena, home of the Detroit Pistons and Detroit Red Wings, hosted games. And for the first time since 1994, the tournament returned to Wichita and the state of Kansas where Intrust Bank Arena hosted first round games.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 847619562, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "366ccaa4a704dc80b545aec75578f6185c0c59ceb289a6a5bb1e9bfe091c5f5f", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "the Alamodome", "matched_aliases": ["the Alamodome"], "query_id": "test495", "question_hash": "f8d358abea49235fcc35c66d4268daa57470618153efc3554be45adf1a31d913", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "a81ee4f88c4bb2a1eed2868ec4dfb82374743a35ec89a017b6a5e31dee7efd28", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 681510077, "similarity": 0.02208835341365462, "source_content_hash": "51056f938757b7b045445037c4814e12fa4ce6d2dfa98ee7a692820022beb607", "source_hash": "c01f5d1f2f6bb940803dc72914191d77f07a87ecaaa2c6e64fb02d27cbbd152f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "55fbe65f21ac339042af7341948ea846cced4940010e10f61bebf19480af1232", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc18362", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Nine years later a young boy named Sam asks Beth if she needs the lawn mowed. Beth suspects that this boy who lives with his \"father\" two blocks away is in fact her lost son, and while Sam mows the lawn, she takes photographs of him to show to her husband and teenage son, who then says that he suspected the boy's true identity all along. The parents contact Detective Candy Bliss who pops in to offer wise, albeit often cryptic and conflicting, advice to Beth. It is learned that at the reunion in Chicago, the celebrity alumna Cecil Lockhart kidnapped Ben, renamed him Sam, and raised him as her own child until she was committed to a mental hospital, leaving Sam to be raised in a house only two blocks from the Cappadoras, by his adoptive father, the sensitive and intellectual George Karras.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1511009924, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "4cbc0e5f3588a26c5db540cdc2fa92c25a02c8ab26312f288fcced6e84b7fb6c", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "celebrity alumna Cecil Lockhart", "matched_aliases": ["celebrity alumna Cecil Lockhart", "Cecil Lockhart"], "query_id": "test498", "question_hash": "d15cf912a5684ce2163f0a5f051331156c6874840d8276bcddb4e0bb4615056b", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "ec4762e3f8494a0e7d61bc65c2f8d67cf1ab9300efc9025cffc0759e65db5870", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1932192607, "similarity": 0.25396825396825395, "source_content_hash": "dd3190c10a533f85497278834e7fab3d392b69c23b884b33b64befb19c1bb07c", "source_hash": "b2ba580f49e40af075523c915926b222f32e90ea0995319c4258cc1b95ab1f7f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "7bb36f24a32ed6a6f142bb373003fe6b94c9b5d657c8c70af943d94053f30a42", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias