{"doc_id": "doc21372", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "However, on October 1, 2014, Maxis confirmed that one of its missing features, swimming pools, along with other new updates and features, would be added into the game for free in November, and this happened in the form of a game patch.[58][59][60] Other features like basements have later been added in subsequent patches, and the missing \"toddler\" life stage was eventually added for free in a patch released on January 12, 2017.[10][11]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1998527933, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "a766307097bdd6a71a9c1e3b351dc3098974964e40c6783b1f8da0ad61297da8", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "January 2017", "matched_aliases": ["January 12, 2017"], "query_id": "test598", "question_hash": "dfd5a24b5a79394448d99b9d72ef0ae4b58cdbb3ac81a4f4b31fb5c9c02225aa", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "a17ffcbb44cc6d315e67cc93aa85b0c472deb050c98c631a3fd865dc21679659", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1128306481, "similarity": 0.24914285714285714, "source_content_hash": "fe2cf316b5aa7678adeb922d44c48aa9a4cfacb83f78405f8905b77889287c10", "source_hash": "2d36e2ee98a654495dd1259614c2d2fc8a94794c2eab049bd7ffedb08ff02bde", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ab4acac335207a0391a8c1e17d42dfcad74a681061a76011685f59256aa68e88", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc21491", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "For the 2020 edition, the all-star teams will be replaced by qualifying teams. There are also plans for a spin-off event beginning in 2018, which would pit a European all-star team against a North American all-star team in a five or seven-game series. This event would also occur every four years, alternating biannually with the World Cup of Hockey. These moves are intended, primarily, to help expand the international prominence of the NHL.[4]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1991553506, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "For the 2020 edition, the all-star teams will be replaced by qualifying teams. There are also plans for a spin-off event beginning in 2018, which would pit a European all-star team against a North American all-star team in a five or seven-game series. This event would also occur every four years, alternating biannually with the World Cup of Hockey. These moves are intended, primarily, to help expand the international prominence of the NHL.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 747864844, "similarity": 0.9966254218222722, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "62b0ca8632eed266bd79debe0b215ee4578f6521437da1d2ae2ea1a0a03f0b2d", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "2020", "matched_aliases": ["2020"], "query_id": "test601", "question_hash": "b2ed2c6319eb00c32869d49b272b60cd478163fdb9f4ad5dbb0acbffec224e70", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "e63faf3e2cd7088108db7dff89f8671fef2bad9363fe1ee590ce72899436d8e4", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 351959399, "similarity": 0.468187274909964, "source_content_hash": "fdaa4c769ac439cc6789d9a3afd378db8444ed112613470ed36ebb56d74675ae", "source_hash": "809ffbcd9ebad082a50952d1df7cc3204ea016aee9ff1edd982442e0777fea79", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"