{"doc_id": "doc21596", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Dragon Ball GT chief character designer Katsuyoshi Nakatsuru stated that he agonized over designing Goku's Super Saiyan 4 appearance, which was the idea of the show's producers, questioning whether it was necessary to go further with the transformations. Because Super Saiyan 4 is brought about while in a Saiyan's Ōzaru (Great Ape) form, he made the hair more \"wild\" and covered Goku's body in red fur. There was only a single final draft of the character, although Nakatsuru did consider making the hair blonde, he ended up choosing black as it provides more contrast with the red fur.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1284468183, "similarity": 0.961082910321489, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "d04784a39e125a1aceae68e28f1a4291edaf751206a92f842dc91b2280a39e73", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Dragon Ball GT", "matched_aliases": ["Dragon Ball GT"], "query_id": "test605", "question_hash": "feff1b28e234444b96de4c12b187fb4f3494df01b4477ec91e34f37b5bd1ba55", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "0b8250b1d1de49b5dae89ded30a585800f5666210519acc95f98cd192a8c587a", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2048770976, "similarity": 0.23646960865945046, "source_content_hash": "c6658218d4a1f3a9f7b16356805405b9dbeb60730da4518c1bb77169d4e50fd9", "source_hash": "488bd1803970197288db8d36266ffd283286f4995b546a16f21494b6e5673170", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "7d1e0ccbf738fce4c0c06da261f2280c8f439a90538f178250eb4170d730271c", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f