{"doc_id": "doc22729", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The designation \"Linux\" was initially used by Torvalds only for the Linux kernel. The kernel was, however, frequently used together with other software, especially that of the GNU project. This quickly became the most popular adoption of GNU software. In June 1994 in GNU's bulletin, Linux was referred to as a \"free UNIX clone\", and the Debian project began calling its product Debian GNU/Linux. In May 1996, Richard Stallman published the editor Emacs 19.31, in which the type of system was renamed from Linux to Lignux. This spelling was intended to refer specifically to the combination of GNU and Linux, but this was soon abandoned in favor of \"GNU/Linux\".", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 595948306, "similarity": 0.9873039581777446, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "b00dd4b934b1d963142633a3252221e0cc4dd7065ab24663e7c2349229bffd9a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "GNU/Linux", "matched_aliases": ["GNU/Linux", "Linux"], "query_id": "test635", "question_hash": "532faf69dc4684770d9013c6bc02c375650485f86443a664215c18148e0c9da4", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "6fc0bb5f9c2999af3c0828139aacecefeff0b6d6ce1a32179db24fcf90d0761f", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 372507189, "similarity": 0.09523809523809523, "source_content_hash": "a7fc389adc2c8b9629291ced15b60604261ff204c25926f11c4047c9171f63bf", "source_hash": "326e0fdf32cc06a35918fad5053d11fd7bf9e46dcd78265596aa7ff90000a5bc", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "c565597acd64df965893b94359acb25d9f21100c8de37942ceefe918ed1fb61f", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc22790", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "First Nations (French: Premières Nations) are the predominant Indigenous peoples in Canada south of the Arctic. Those in the Arctic area are distinct and known as Inuit. The Métis, another distinct ethnicity, developed after European contact and relations primarily between First Nations people and Europeans.[2] There are currently 634[3] recognized First Nations governments or bands spread across Canada, roughly half of which are in the provinces of Ontario and British Columbia.[4]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 388816494, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "c311d8b4c0539c610b18af029830bde492f339120d50bc52a7040b10c810d1f5", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "south of the Arctic", "matched_aliases": ["south of the Arctic"], "query_id": "test637", "question_hash": "45069f56571bed9b8e3e4c850fab28ca1d018905772d1317d8e00233bcb1dceb", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "f1f8309b0d4be742b7885b38ff223a1c1f631e9324d9cdd515d571a27a566584", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 726502067, "similarity": 0.355464759959142, "source_content_hash": "0f5b666f4b54f0b3373d57ef247f26804805210840c410f2cd9383415efb173a", "source_hash": "ae7b338a6c07402f63440ac93bb4838aaf72985edb2c167caae2200f8c5a9884", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "e5719d4d6f98eb4fc3797d7e3d6c5ec2d3f44a5dc07e51ffa65e4d3f42ea8e3e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc22918", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Cory Allan Michael Monteith (/mɒnˈtiːθ/; May 11, 1982 – July 13, 2013) was a Canadian actor and musician, known for his role as Finn Hudson on the Fox television series Glee.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 42674385, "similarity": 0.9914040114613181, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "8943943566113e71c2ca933b115008abd0a6b54c2dcfda00833485abee98ce2a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Cory Allan Michael Monteith", "matched_aliases": ["Cory Allan Michael Monteith"], "query_id": "test640", "question_hash": "599605c8992b4348cf85f4a91c212f23bf2bd6076077832a4b0ecd5ae710c6d7", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "bf48b958e3477235033359df59bc72a4224b7f55c8ed7f0363ffb79e32973f99", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 933726907, "similarity": 0.7170868347338936, "source_content_hash": "041e6bb3ac46edaf0556b1d6844565f404849c15184612d525edb2c6c557acf8", "source_hash": "8df216bbf3f842898a896d8e47ecbf77d7f11125eff9799dd450e78b578e71bd", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "e9b97fb24edb470500b1507ae49f7a4ffa8b10dd2a03052c0a2854a8c94d2ee4", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc22939", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Keith Thibodeaux (born December 1, 1950) is a former American child actor of television and film and musician, best known for playing Little Ricky on the television sitcom's I Love Lucy and The Lucy-Desi Comedy Hour, his last name \"Thibodeaux\" which was Cajun French was changed by co-star Desi Arnaz, to \"Keith\" because his surname was more difficult to pronounce. He is the last living regular appearing cast member from I Love Lucy.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 413834787, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "0ce0b6fdf7a1ff1d6b22610de4c20860cfbf13d1ed053df91ba026bcd10065ef", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Keith Thibodeaux", "matched_aliases": ["Keith Thibodeaux"], "query_id": "test641", "question_hash": "c0b55fda4a7b5fa39f873d8aa57f295aaba904bf35811cb7f9547a3ef59e677d", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4002d7fb141a2dde528a9a244d4777a7f6f26dcedeb53a2768528cb223f7ff11", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 532110101, "similarity": 0.2648845686512758, "source_content_hash": "8b14c9232e9def8389d5c3dbcc9447c44c1616b5c7c9abc0bd7f9bab1c5ff0a4", "source_hash": "4bd191f59bb9898a54855178c54730a5ecae9cb0d6655955b9dff4e26344aee4", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "4a252ef2e66a392b075c8533dee8242c2fe6fef13624998d9c4dc4c4db007f63", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
