{"doc_id": "doc31925", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "At the beginning of Season 6, April is planning on attending Veterinary School; however, upon going to the orientation with Ann she realizes it is not what she wants to do. While she supports Andy for having a job away in London, she is very upset while he is away and misses him. She develops a closer relationship with Donna, and they both try to stop Tom leaving the Parks Department by being unhelpful as he searches for a property for his restaurant. However, they later feel guilty, and help him find the perfect place. When Andy returns, she actively supports him on playing music for children, deciding to become his manager. While she makes out she is excited that Ann is leaving Pawnee, the pair share a nostalgic farewell at the Pawnee Commons site in \"Ann and Chris\". Along with Andy, Tom and some other Pawnee youths, she comes up with the idea of holding a Unity concert celebrating the merger. In the season finale, April has Leslie named a founder of the revamped city of Pawnee and motivates her to convince the National Park Service to move the Midwest Branch to Pawnee, which allows Leslie and Ben to stay. In addition, it is revealed that April and Andy are still happily married in 2017, with April working for Leslie.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 54097105, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "dbcdea54aeaecb31207c3afeb9356bc73e9eabc8855a197a813275657b9d05af", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Andy", "matched_aliases": ["Andy"], "query_id": "test894", "question_hash": "2bd7b7146251699f8d5b3c422f5d7c98e81cda8ade08ab9a342704a960199b70", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "51a3f07b134a5ca1a22fb39b4ecd4c2e0aaa7c5e872161286b691093c61728b0", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1814800479, "similarity": 0.08333333333333333, "source_content_hash": "de5ec66be437b02d03d6c216ec26d85028bb2391f7b3d19227b7005175b93852", "source_hash": "5331191fa1f667514034d93285f3c581a908ffd33187e67b61ebc2490a7e2510", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "03fcf95d514734e16e43d306e06548ab77014e3abbadde6cf9dc4adae4146d33", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc31927", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In a series of flash-forwards in the final episode, April and Andy ask Leslie and Ben for advice regarding the prospect of having children, which Andy very much wants but April does not. They decide to try for it and their son Jack (short for Jack-o-Lantern) is born on Halloween 2023. By 2025 the couple is expecting their second child.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1992107440, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "7a163fdfcd58bf4ba849aac32604efbe7f0beb82dbca015efc12cd3a8f37f248", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Andy", "matched_aliases": ["Andy"], "query_id": "test894", "question_hash": "2bd7b7146251699f8d5b3c422f5d7c98e81cda8ade08ab9a342704a960199b70", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "25a6ecc3137311477aabcc30a2b60126d5deb69b3c6ebad5e97ecdda5e8b5444", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 549307541, "similarity": 0.6175637393767706, "source_content_hash": "28d7c023f7fb0d86c0c7a3c31b6b9066d756d89b45f1fcd80310a616ac359c04", "source_hash": "9171632aa5bd4f19bb121d72a046873e9643b7721ef364953642ffa12310bd61", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ff070e50fed51bbbc9f3181c99e389f36fe15f62ffc19853fd4d4dc28bfa964f", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc31929", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "\"The Farm\" is the seventeenth episode of the ninth season of the American comedy television series The Office and the 192nd overall. It originally aired on NBC on March 14, 2013. The episode guest stars Matt Jones as Dwight's cousin Zeke, Majandra Delfino as Dwight's sister Fannie, Blake Garrett Rosenthal as his nephew, and Thomas Middleditch as his brother.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1884075743, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "e7874b96e8e18939e5aa043caf5c9993d98c3fab7dc430b052d325371f1d42ee", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Thomas Middleditch", "matched_aliases": ["Thomas Middleditch"], "query_id": "test895", "question_hash": "2f2f14a867c687a795ce95a82b03b122458d5070f8eecd6f054111f4753a6cc8", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "77364be6612f529249cecb52d7d7bfafe4628dafd4d3468b70d7d18ae326d364", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1606685821, "similarity": 0.2995720399429387, "source_content_hash": "ef5715ea0c19b8fb239dc6c8492f9ec055b76ba16587385e5f19fa53b1a1ae44", "source_hash": "f9978e233004edd9c838bef7932d6bd9b2aea6b307926102c2d47c47360d03df", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "31a4a5353921e9b7a95181baaf34b8fb8d929b6087ab81aae95d48ed2aca432b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
