{"doc_id": "doc34406", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 2015 World Series was the championship series of Major League Baseball's (MLB) 2015 season. The 111th edition of the World Series, it was a best-of-seven playoff between the National League (NL) champion New York Mets and the American League (AL) champion Kansas City Royals. The series was played between October 27 and November 1, with the Royals winning the series 4 games to 1. It was the first time since the 2010 World Series that the World Series extended into November.[2] The Royals became the first team since the Oakland Athletics in the 1989 World Series to win the World Series after losing in the previous year. It was the first World Series to feature only expansion teams and the first since the 2007 World Series to not feature the Philadelphia Phillies, St. Louis Cardinals, or San Francisco Giants as the NL champions.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1280959334, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "a8eb8be758ac3bfeec9cf859da091d7d4e46fa779f6f1d2262dd20b9814b7d3a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "2015", "matched_aliases": ["2015"], "query_id": "test979", "question_hash": "da0e7717fd67aaa45a2896c3e1dbf617982085c2f24b1215eff0b21605273ebe", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "5e7f701c951c872e10a7df50f4ba4e30da05c1d4fcbf2309dd3631e8afa1b323", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1853501337, "similarity": 0.2150997150997151, "source_content_hash": "89c5543a11b08a451b0d6c2ea81765976555d3066f9cfaab08aaa2d7d2cad869", "source_hash": "1502560d2000a454ce4eabec8d339dad1997332ba471fde904059a0e5f62ed9d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "74e458b3f5684e555eb654ea96af5b6f51d6b3ab9274732a8dfa5a45fbc77d7a", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc34495", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Initially, host nation Russia matched the Soviet Union's 1976 achievement of thirteen gold medals,[α] but 4 gold medals (13 overall) were stripped later due to doping. Norway achieved the leading position in the medal table on 24 November 2017, when Russia was stripped of two gold medals in bobsleigh.[β] However, at the end of January 2018, the Court of Arbitration for Sport cleared 28 Russian athletes and 9 out of 13 medals (including 3 gold) were reinstated, allowing Russia to return to the top position.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1620851663, "similarity": 0.9970731707317073, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "423e61f8dde05ac9d3e6e72bfc708221bf73fe3653750eb5eb1ec213ae6befb8", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Russia", "matched_aliases": ["Russia"], "query_id": "test983", "question_hash": "50cb12841403068a0cebbcdd4056930c4476c6d4cffbaa358d007ac122608213", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "791d9d1345685175836a55b38c6f9edd0aff7ce7d0c9d057f78e492ca7a3c9ec", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1102790527, "similarity": 0.6443202979515829, "source_content_hash": "09ffa9505f5563c3fa45695b30182af84004026d13de79a31a9fda27b0e9b405", "source_hash": "d5348d1a9bbd1a21c4ce62d9068b2c3a6e1d1d8c7526a6e8c1ba19a3437f6d7b", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "2acccf40dd0961eca8ef600090386ea45a7677b43f41507759ade60daa6a57d9", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc34541", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Realizing that gambling would be profitable for local business, the Nevada state legislature legalized gambling at the local level in 1931. Las Vegas, with a small but already well-established illegal gambling industry, was poised to begin its rise as the gaming capital of the world. The county issued the first gambling license in 1931 to the Northern Club, and soon other casinos were licensed on Fremont Street like the Las Vegas Club and the Apache Hotel. Fremont Street became the first paved street in Las Vegas and received the city's first traffic light in 1931.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1829982710, "similarity": 0.9965095986038395, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "2bcac26eaa0b89f037809e910bfdc962930beb44e9079dfc5802c8fa2eb35538", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "1931", "matched_aliases": ["1931", "In 1931"], "query_id": "test985", "question_hash": "1beb6659d3ef7417e106148b3bdeebdd225919392d68fb2f04da80b25583b171", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "0d983df1b5f83685933e11fd192c709493b2a1f5fdcb822bb9b41ad474938e49", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1351972186, "similarity": 0.3606853020739405, "source_content_hash": "df285a09fa3816a81cb777c82710a152d4a3d034d73e2bc977a68cbb5a378d3a", "source_hash": "f0dd11fa23a84760131900385deeffb4a2062b1583d9768862bb4152d9a2d450", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "b2ebac42d33aa3c340e40aa2cfc96b787c758c4827eeb9bdeb93e64344380cb1", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231