{"doc_id": "doc35979", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "This was the first common style of shark tooth, present in the plentiful cladodont teeth of the devonian, four hundred million years ago. Sharks with needle-like teeth commonly feed on small to medium-sized fish, sometimes including small sharks. These teeth are especially effective for such prey because they can easily grip their slippery and narrow bodies. Modern examples include the blue shark and bull sharks. These sharks specifically use their teeth to feed on small prey like squid, flounder, stingrays, and even hammerhead sharks.[4]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1710379862, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "b8098fb04199f837878151520397cd98e77da989cbd12c679187e7f23f48ea32", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "needle-like teeth", "matched_aliases": ["needle-like teeth", "needle-like"], "query_id": "test1021", "question_hash": "b492641c674e444faf2e11a6ce3ce741230c343f379f800797df076ad817733a", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "7dbb5e1d4733e2e984d90ee4e2ee2954ad62fdb5abb2654b29f7025f7be2291a", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 217834226, "similarity": 0.02374893977947413, "source_content_hash": "99c9701e71cf784d15eea7a2ad029437dd8fb7b0f0bc2b4cc4c7506a196e00e1", "source_hash": "c797eea1a82d463e4d21c5ed67ceb27cbc15a9a073e03a633c08321103f54450", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "90b8d35f271fc0166792d7f998640a6d3d86042536fd0e6a48bab0fffd571a3e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc35993", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Staci Keanan (born Anastasia Love Sagorsky on June 6, 1975) is a former American actress and attorney. Keanan is best known for her roles in the television series My Two Dads (1987–1990) and Step by Step (1991–1998). She has also been credited as Stacy Keenan and Staci Love.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1301212051, "similarity": 0.9892086330935251, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Staci Keanan, born Anastasia Love Sagorsky on June 6, 1975, is a former American actress and attorney best known for her roles in the television series My Two Dads (1987–1990) and Step by Step (1991–1998). She has also been credited as Stacy Keenan and Staci Love.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 588215811, "similarity": 0.9577981651376147, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "77bf1c78ccc9f5d0115d396edbc83597c024a62b8877399361b1e010cd2ad05c", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Staci Keanan", "matched_aliases": ["Staci Keanan"], "query_id": "test1022", "question_hash": "b4a1f0a22b4a1ab6a8e31e0a0442d38d38b7f7700665e603f8704467876e7745", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "eeaa4ee3c023bade553e6702b89b5f8a42dc84e2be2170e97c892a4ea0c73302", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 542758153, "similarity": 0.780952380952381, "source_content_hash": "4cc3326d3bb61c5f22856e52ba9d35d46b2a81a2789ceaca5333aa94b290b928", "source_hash": "b13ad4ee424cd12a6c6c24aa206cacc235be7325b31a00fee7173f2966c98927", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a691f4f0e8562a4b111b18b3f00e1b9e44d0b1951b7a3a8a3bee82602a166def", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc35996", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": false, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "At the age of 12, shortly after she moved with her family to Los Angeles, California, she was cast as Nicole Bradford in the TV series My Two Dads. The series ran from 1987 to 1990. During the 1990-91 season, she co-starred in the short-lived series Going Places with Alan Ruck, Heather Locklear, and Hallie Todd. The following year, Keanan was cast as Dana Foster in the TV series Step by Step which aired from 1991 to 1998. By 1997 Keanan had changed her name from Staci to Stacy.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 389838381, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "At the age of 12, shortly after she moved with her family to Los Angeles, California, she was cast as Nicole Bradford in the TV series My Two Dads, a role she played while the program ran from 1987 to 1990. During the 1990-91 season, she co-starred in the short-lived series Going Places with Alan Ruck, Heather Locklear, and Hallie Todd. The following year, Keanan was cast as Dana Foster in the TV series Step by Step which aired from 1991 to 1998. By 1997 Keanan had changed her name from Staci to Stacy.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1547934824, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "17ea5a73e9d73a218549e88053248b389683539e4c6ad59f0d0e922a5c4b7cbe", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Staci Keanan", "matched_aliases": ["Staci Keanan"], "query_id": "test1022", "question_hash": "b4a1f0a22b4a1ab6a8e31e0a0442d38d38b7f7700665e603f8704467876e7745", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "7faa9130cb434b2350d4ab969f9abda35858ed4863df7dfe6b8b39cd912cf5e1", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 320955587, "similarity": 0.31203566121842496, "source_content_hash": "b1681ce74e51a2490ac22be4cc53082289881101867dcb987c6fdcb88e0c9b17", "source_hash": "434e9e77dabeeb6ea5f7b02480671