{"doc_id": "doc36987", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the episode \"Kobol's Last Gleaming,\" Commander Adama sends Boomer on a mission to destroy the basestar orbiting Kobol. On the basestar, she encounters numerous other Number Eight copies identical to herself but she refuses to accept she is a Cylon and personally sets the bomb. After returning to Galactica, her hidden programming takes over and she shoots Commander Adama twice in the chest, putting him in a coma. She is put in the brig and violently interrogated by Colonel Tigh, who has taken command of Galactica during Adama's incapacity. Tyrol is also suspected of being a Cylon because of his relationship with her, and is thrown in her cell. He tells her not to speak to him or even touch him; he insists she is a machine and nothing like him.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1729028347, "similarity": 0.9986754966887417, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "8a8c4fd1a304fec8cde45a11176e51f19e53185b9c728e961be1ea49fda31892", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Kobol's Last Gleaming", "matched_aliases": ["Kobol's Last Gleaming"], "query_id": "test1062", "question_hash": "30d4504a5d82577dca47ab031088388b40e6887d1dc5a6a0b9e71e94d80ff420", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "faa75be72fe11ed94b0fd626ba91e86c1074673daf7acc28be2066494de058c4", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 800234503, "similarity": 0.05699481865284974, "source_content_hash": "2e15ed51bd5ade22c36fa711da4113831b52e5d5dcbb8c7d35a410a042457278", "source_hash": "2496b34ba3bd41d6f6c66e4c24a2d12acdbc7113f5f2ddd8bc89f7e4181e0b73", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6c1ed5aa2ae8f6b2c779b1bf365752de1081bd04435bdf42ddbf22e9d00148a7", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "determinis