{"doc_id": "doc37281", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Cash flow statement\nFinancing activities include the inflow of cash from investors such as banks and shareholders, as well as the outflow of cash to shareholders as dividends as the company generates income. Other activities which impact the long-term liabilities and equity of the company are also listed in the financing activities section of the cash flow statement.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 961508893, "similarity": 0.9721448467966574, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "8085344b03e4d4df93b3a021e2a2523bb66c2d8bb7b77e52168983b41449ad3e", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "the financing activities section", "matched_aliases": ["the financing activities section"], "query_id": "test1071", "question_hash": "bb1d39bad53861cc758350c197760ded8396d5c6f2c2c4d51526cb03328041c6", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "254d12948fa7dd1bf07f3d977eca9eb52dec20a73875ae4e642d4f04b0f31417", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 861264143, "similarity": 0.25914634146341464, "source_content_hash": "66df5bb753f2d110db4c5e3191734d33a35bef0c635fd8715ab4be2442df484c", "source_hash": "c048de8df771c8022acdda53cb39387c3c3f4bf71c4dc2569f5cc6dcffed21a4", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "0632af6261d85a68550b76c29d03f7ba9b5a3a634274cffe17df5dfdb7b45e95", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc37298", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 180th meridian or antimeridian is the meridian 180 degrees east or west of the Prime Meridian, with which it forms a great circle dividing the earth into the Western and Eastern Hemispheres. It is common to both east longitude and west longitude. It is used as the basis for the International Date Line because it mostly passes through the open waters of the Pacific Ocean. However, the meridian passes through Russia and Fiji as well as Antarctica.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 950267111, "similarity": 0.9856035437430787, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "ebdfa2c2f02b724af560bd497f1d0afeb98bf9e42e7f679b88e9baf1e7a3f288", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "180th meridian or antimeridian", "matched_aliases": ["180th meridian", "antimeridian"], "query_id": "test1072", "question_hash": "0d66a1a5ec8ff546c2bc608a390026d24ad0bd3611bfd0bfe242218394df5f01", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "efc5885a3631e01680ae5bfbe6067672ca1616a2f82ae49ca674b2ab5086afd8", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 554127436, "similarity": 0.05476673427991886, "source_content_hash": "82c71df2a7ab5195339ab3aed2029d046c2aa0cfc059bef481ee4edde14053c6", "source_hash": "b495fc18a19b33a8ac2170fa894205998eb332b103c741fe85b6b489ed11928b", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "b327ab529ae4dad0214bb566bed880705d91b8271f719e3825d384f212e1e4d2", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc37303", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Dirk Benedict (born Dirk Niewoehner on March 1, 1945) is an American movie, television and stage actor and author. He is best known for playing the characters Lieutenant Templeton \"Faceman\" Peck in The A-Team television series and Lieutenant Starbuck in the original Battlestar Galactica film and television series. He is the author of Confessions of a Kamikaze Cowboy and And Then We Went Fishing.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 442897464, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "661a8e16db00108480c979b291fd8c910a2865a1fff997b0257a4066b4e6ae54", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Dirk Benedict", "matched_aliases": ["Dirk Benedict"], "query_id": "test1073", "question_hash": "98887711812956c24a70382d15a861442c069319c78115dd763c550a79136437", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "213581ecbc43adfd1ee3743952b47a91003df303bd074825c6bb769f9658c4ed", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 240733397, "similarity": 0.5975820379965457, "source_content_hash": "20d548c3d895f38ace7a56f095494b4926b08db074dc69f6c074776a6c89eb17", "source_hash": "becc99b1e97fc0ef03242bb6f2cd8ea1976c11b42c0ed3959274b7ba7c7fa5dc", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "8245c85b6e3c9d3cd707ad60c467472a061f15a32b8295fcd5f92a1b7fc38b9c", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc37322", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 2010 eruptions of Eyjafjallajökull were volcanic events at Eyjafjallajökull in Iceland which, although relatively small for volcanic eruptions, caused enormous disruption to air travel across western and northern Europe over an initial period of six days in April 2010. Additional localised disruption continued into May 2010. The eruption was declared officially over in October 2010, when snow on the glacier did not melt. From 14–20 April, ash from the volcanic eruption covered large areas of Northern Europe. About 20 countries closed their airspace to commercial jet traffic and it affected approximately 10 million travellers.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1741229607, "similarity": 0.9976507439310884, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "5d895dc42a37302e97c0ef1450c469b21b413869b1c10a230c27b36c417b0c77", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "2010", "matched_aliases": ["2010"], "query_id": "test1075", "question_hash": "4545a7ce9cfd61c67448c1f2dac88546e38e25425e80eab386e1759280a6b575", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4c7fd83ac2d412e2c4e51a368456f1da29b2c1b06f43253ae72af314f52fa913", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 637190515, "similarity": 0.06837606837606838, "source_content_hash": "97cbd329f5b70ea6f81005e7281d735ae4d2ab55f1645987cb65a83d36cb1f4e", "source_hash": "c768b9679a95ff303cfd8ba368e43534167170a6b45c5778fb5ca2bf69ec15a4", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "9b492b0f5b11101f8572003db90d37c48d52f4bfe0fe61ca8d222ec98794af22", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_has