{"doc_id": "doc48239", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "A typical explanation found in the scientific literature for the evolution of light hair is related to the evolution of light skin, and in turn the requirement for vitamin D synthesis and northern Europe's seasonal less solar radiation. Lighter skin is due to a low concentration in pigmentation, thus allowing more sunlight to trigger the production of vitamin D. In this way, high frequencies of light hair in northern latitudes are a result of the light skin adaptation to lower levels of solar radiation, which reduces the prevalence of rickets caused by vitamin D deficiency. The darker pigmentation at higher latitudes in certain ethnic groups such as the Inuit is explained by a greater proportion of seafood in their diet and by the climate which they live in, because in the polar climate there is more ice or snow on the ground, and this reflects the solar radiation onto the skin, making this environment lack the conditions for the person to have blond, brown or red hair, light skin and blue, grey or green eyes.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1354466006, "similarity": 0.9980525803310614, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "14b9cdfd276931aace80339fc5ad1f0fd67fe793960fa5acec0ca7a63314a36a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "a low concentration in pigmentation", "matched_aliases": ["a low concentration in pigmentation"], "query_id": "test1366", "question_hash": "c46197fd33288fada3432326419ea57382d2b04b4b3a5ecc29fdda3ce63ae2a2", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "c82f359ba3a74516e02188a040bece49093acf4142e4a5e8047738ab0fd68d7b", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 949798248, "similarity": 0.04235044997353097, "source_content_hash": "252589fe9481c8798b865cd42d7480c70947d38beb3bb1cb281b782fe40a0057", "source_hash": "1fa1fd79e3537000255503d87fc8643de358b9ef01865d422c862947c444938d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "e6c1365c94aa252f5f42c3420a3ce8ba9e08a2271b2510e4b165c05046bc099f", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc48352", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Tomb Raider is a 2018 action-adventure film directed by Roar Uthaug, with a screenplay by Geneva Robertson-Dworet and Alastair Siddons, from a story by Evan Daugherty and Robertson-Dworet. It is based on the 2013 video game of the same name, with some elements of its sequel by Crystal Dynamics, and is a reboot of the Tomb Raider film series. The film stars Alicia Vikander as Lara Croft, who embarks on a perilous journey to her father's last-known destination, hoping to solve the mystery of his disappearance. Dominic West, Walton Goggins, Daniel Wu, and Kristin Scott Thomas appear in supporting roles.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 504614276, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Tomb Raider, a 2018 action-adventure film directed by Roar Uthaug and written by Geneva Robertson-Dworet and Alastair Siddons based on a story by Evan Daugherty, stars Alicia Vikander as the central character Lara Croft. While the movie draws inspiration from a 2013 video game and features elements from Crystal Dynamics' sequel, it serves as a reboot of the original franchise. In this production, Alicia Vikander plays the lead role, while Dominic West, Walton Goggins, Daniel Wu, and Kristin Scott Thomas provide supporting performances.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 82224825, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "3786003354c61e718c81d7506a58d7a28e9e8e94ef5da0bc5413f7f0726e2bb6", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Alicia Vikander as Lara Croft", "matched_aliases": ["Alicia Vikander as Lara Croft"], "query_id": "test1368", "question_hash": "ce6ef58c530925dceb6b91e7db49b9e634dbc4aacffa383b6acb78ea9c1c8c5e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "d834775dce3802acba493e1b299d95009d7f9184cda07251fdaa881881bb707a", "scope": "all_answer_document