{"doc_id": "doc54800", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Originally introduced as a classical tax system, in which companies were subject to tax on their profits and companies' shareholders were also liable to income tax on the dividends that they received, the first major amendment to corporation tax saw it move to a dividend imputation system in 1973, under which an individual receiving a dividend became entitled to an income tax credit representing the corporation tax already paid by the company paying the dividend. The classical system was reintroduced in 1999, with the abolition of advance corporation tax and of repayable dividend tax credits. Another change saw the single main rate of tax split into three. Tax competition between jurisdictions reduced the main corporate tax rate from 28% in 2008-2010 to a flat rate of 20% as of April 2015.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 836092214, "similarity": 0.9962640099626401, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "dba4d98aea105f68e23b0496701b5f3c085eb708d92a0e132d23558b49429cb3", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "20%", "matched_aliases": ["20%"], "query_id": "test1530", "question_hash": "377fa605fd33863bbea0d6879caab799bb5bc9baa64945746e6d3f87088f8469", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "7ec2671c4eb1e32bc78adeb2177776a39f4351b624940b390c12fcea93197b43", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1557196213, "similarity": 0.14508474576271185, "source_content_hash": "e34377407a2e1d4e64e67847c03635789b1d523cb5eccb29f4fed0ae30ecd999", "source_hash": "a0eec67568fed84d020c8f94cc7b3d1b71873d1e5836f677084dea316f16e640", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "961a8839c3dc99cc5be7dafa0afb081e898439013c5b6f602809236439e36fca", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc54946", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The first installment, Divergent (2014), grossed over $288 million worldwide, while the second installment, The Divergent Series: Insurgent (2015), grossed over $297 million worldwide. Insurgent was also the first Divergent film to be released in IMAX 3D. The third installment, The Divergent Series: Allegiant (2016), grossed $179 million. Thus, the first three films of the series have grossed over $765 million worldwide. A fourth film, The Divergent Series: Ascendant was never made, due to Allegiant's poor showing at the box office.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 927053245, "similarity": 0.9917050691244239, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The Divergent Series comprises three films that have collectively earned over $765 million in worldwide box office receipts. However, the series' fourth installment, The Divergent Series: Ascendant, was never produced. This decision followed Allegiant's poor performance at the box office, which prevented the creation of the intended fourth movie.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 842039334, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "667fdbac7d3bad956a48f5663e473b240ff477bd675e6423d99905b9b78c5675", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "never made", "matched_aliases": ["never made"], "query_id": "test1533", "question_hash": "0df77042b88e7225dabe5b17fb6c97db0073ec7b44df9dbce6c7f289ca5f2269", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "5d262feb19f9c7802c02e100c06f1b5cc98fbe06c3f33c73d7f8c0263d388dfe", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 839167762, "similarity": 0.3041182682154171, "source_content_hash": "1f4264e418a5f7f5356d7511e204cde6e8ea9ac7ee2dbbce70f90577e6fa5c58", "source_hash": "94e72982db8e866ad2127637d4c389786e78e40010664d2033d7bfb359467954", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validatio