{"doc_id": "doc60266", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Southend Pier is a major landmark in Southend-on-Sea, extending 1.34 miles (2.16 km) into the Thames Estuary, and it is the longest pleasure pier in the world. Sir John Betjeman once said that \"the Pier is Southend, Southend is the Pier.\" The pier is a Grade II listed building.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 727824236, "similarity": 0.9644128113879004, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "f89d36379eed594a9008ed3393f5d00bd26cb3d5b6b8f28514a3a000b84a0144", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Southend Pier", "matched_aliases": ["Southend Pier"], "query_id": "test1698", "question_hash": "4376ed762772a83e615bc9c8ccaa1a5fcf88b345e0bf40315d3e0c1353d745c3", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4ed02888cf9f4b102c522361afcb44b30eede31b0657b8bf0551388c4522a9a9", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 662403566, "similarity": 0.5662650602409639, "source_content_hash": "bb82010167ad12ce71ba7cb4376693cdaa60a6257a3a2cc49146d0dbd75bf834", "source_hash": "91ece3d7cc91b1f4a91234826a003c0a843fbfde37879c05ea2fdda9e499176d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a43bd768cdcf91a8f67ebf68da90df279c0bc3d7be0d529bf9adbf44cb1438f1", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc60311", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Miller's Daughter (Once Upon a Time)\n\nThe day before her wedding, Cora questions her plans; she is unlikely to become queen as Henry is fifth in line to the throne, while Rumplestiltskin, with whom she has been having an affair, offers her love. They agree to amend the contract so Cora owes Rumplestiltskin his child. He also agrees to teach her how to take a heart, so that she can kill King Xavier. That night, she confronts the king. He reveals that he knows of her relationship with Rumplestiltskin; telling her that \"love is weakness,\" he lays out her choice between love and power. Cora returns to her room carrying a heart in a box. Later, she meets Rumplestilskin and informs him that she did not take the king's heart, and that she is going to marry the prince instead of running away with Rumplestiltskin. The heart she removed was her own, to prevent it from being an obstacle. Rumplestiltskin tries to invoke their contract, but she points out that he only has a claim on his own child, which she will never bear.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1481355246, "similarity": 0.979187314172448, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "1a5125dbd383a7a83507caa8693670e42ca4cc4e28be973f494e825055953919", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Henry", "matched_aliases": ["Henry"], "query_id": "test1699", "question_hash": "29744e7ae61b49171679d8aafd152fcaa099957a9117f694e7eac6e5c442bbf7", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "6b7682a6b6b5feba2811bd48df97e844bb7c9e525f0aecefe222ba6ee2e39d22", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1395156055, "similarity": 0.029094827586206896, "source_content_hash": "7c7d8bc9e8be601f2f7e7a653e0be85a3d2491d5c4ef1c9387ee4f6720ab08fe", "source_hash": "c576ee8dc5d05330edeec0128c742b6d79a823a5dbd61d75550876df9dc010a2", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "d58efe7ea4d2309ad5a58f6d27f105520d77b644f82d15aca34edd1cb88333fd", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
