{"doc_id": "doc61878", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": false, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In an interview with Catalunya Ràdio, Del Rey stated that she had three new songs for her third extended play, Paradise, including \"Will You Still Love Me When I'm No Longer Young and Beautiful.\" Del Rey sang the chorus of \"Young and Beautiful\" during the Catalunya Ràdio broadcast.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 174742101, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "067734133e86c02e973658519de8a320b5742c83826feca2c196c5b67c63f4b6", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Lana Del Rey", "matched_aliases": ["Lana Del Rey"], "query_id": "test1756", "question_hash": "0066967665f12ac2efd9b4ece65c769f728e9e2732f278e1878c45e1abba0ef0", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "05a33b09d86123153df9170613b90a7ce2ae6155dfed2f821733660891ec5ac1", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 374665886, "similarity": 0.26778242677824265, "source_content_hash": "cf01cd84db5fac8b30e2b21c3233328ea2783d4a07a6f18d1c06b1c0aa61fb7c", "source_hash": "a4c97226dbc5da4b28108d9672bf9387c651f8c15c0a3a346b9db745b1bef684", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "904cd801f4abd5b202583e51ed8ad753fa9edbb3012ebab48fd1143abea909d2", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc61882", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": false, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "With the lyrics \"Will you still love me when I'm no longer young and beautiful?\", Del Rey adds a hint of desperation which parallels the idiosyncrasies faced by the characters in F. Scott Fitzgerald's classic novel The Great Gatsby.[9] Del Rey's dreamy vocals are draped over sedated strings and canned percussion.[9] The soft and dreary vocals, falling in line with Del Rey's retro affectation, fits the atmosphere of the 1920s when the novel is set.[10] The lyrics rotate around the themes of pleasing a lover, nostalgia, and the gloom of aging.[11] The Cedric Gervais remix of the song was released on October 11, 2013.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2053745438, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "With the lyrics \"Will you still love me when I'm no longer young and beautiful?\", Del Rey adds a hint of desperation which parallels the idiosyncrasies faced by the characters in F. Scott Fitzgerald's classic novel The Great Gatsby.[9] Del Rey's dreamy vocals are draped over sedated strings and canned percussion.[9] The soft and dreary vocals, falling in line with Del Rey's retro affectation, fits the atmosphere of the 1920s when the novel is set.[10] The lyrics rotate around the themes of pleasing a lover, nostalgia, and the gloom of aging.[11] The Cedric Gervais remix of the song was released on October 11, 2013.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1710501628, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "e24717ded80a642006e8e60ffe05cb856451bd51737374117e08276c09c5e102", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Lana Del Rey", "matched_aliases": ["Lana Del Rey"], "query_id": "test1756", "question_hash": "0066967665f12ac2efd9b4ece65c769f728e9e2732f278e1878c45e1abba0ef0", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "cfaeaa633aeba1e8d3e01302773561