{"doc_id": "doc67889", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Since 1979/80, all Test cricket has been played with six balls per over. However, overs in Test cricket originally had four balls per over, and there have been varying numbers of balls per over around the world up to 1979/80, generally the same as the number of balls per over in force in other first-class cricket in that country.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 344930024, "similarity": 0.9954887218045113, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Over (cricket)\nSince 1979/80, all Test cricket has been played with six balls per over. However, overs in Test cricket originally had four balls per over, and there have been varying numbers of balls per over around the world up to 1979/80, generally the same as the number of balls per over in force in other first-class cricket in that country.[4]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1711524085, "similarity": 0.9780380673499268, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "d9da86a08675ad3746b8399f8a6502d404f26310a0fe1205a0b665cae215f61b", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "1979/80", "matched_aliases": ["1979/80"], "query_id": "test1937", "question_hash": "13d011944bdbbee4a2e15ca98c4752a02fc649a94a3643342779442e4f31d752", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "d9ec07b0f4ad3a0ac2b6acac1e6082d4d540334bb43874b0e6dbe0d895830542", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 925591266, "similarity": 0.10588235294117647, "source_content_hash": "ec06a51d77571c6b84dd7e4b5bb1067fb65d206c0fe90ad06a93a0b390638ebe", "source_hash": "046a05631c9d028bc7a57a6f9c8e683802d124ce1f9e7708ba16987afe9ea85f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "d0cb479b07715807493759f3be6f691e29d889b3f6302888802b113f160b1fd8", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "no