{"doc_id": "doc68553", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Geographic South Pole is located on the continent of Antarctica (although this has not been the case for all of Earth's history because of continental drift). It sits atop a featureless, barren, windswept and icy plateau at an altitude of 2,835 metres (9,301 ft) above sea level, and is located about 1,300 km (800 mi) from the nearest open sea at Bay of Whales. The ice is estimated to be about 2,700 metres (9,000 ft) thick at the Pole, so the land surface under the ice sheet is actually near sea level.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1769019981, "similarity": 0.989247311827957, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "47d67a51f337882e74695b0c2488b08c84ff3519c7ab222f67e40b279e8d1551", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "on the continent of Antarctica", "matched_aliases": ["on the continent of Antarctica"], "query_id": "test1953", "question_hash": "a3251664f29795cf1225a6adf675084180f880cef7805eb58f546811c0dd3de9", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "067ead032287c49abe219b837c305e3c106d769db61916d0fa876688cd6b4ad2", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1720558037, "similarity": 0.2857142857142857, "source_content_hash": "87ac138bfd6bb38015a35f4dafae3adccff2c78692973f943837f4f002156290", "source_hash": "2610fdf6dff39d5fd8b84626b91ae7519d35237f7866b76a63b8458b5d976d5f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "dadfdcf003869a117da12796b8f3ee17732e62881af0b33e9ce6c7ecce02391a", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc68584", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In 1947 full-scale war broke out between the Viet Minh and France. Realizing that colonialism was coming to an end worldwide, France fashioned a semi-independent State of Vietnam, within the French Union, with Bảo Đại as Head of State. Meanwhile, as the Communists under Mao Zedong took over China, the Viet Minh began to receive military aid from China. Beside supplying materials, Chinese cadres also pressured the Vietnamese Communist Party, then under First Secretary Trường Chinh, to emulate their brand of revolution, unleashing a purge of \"bourgeois and feudal\" elements from the Viet Minh ranks, carrying out a ruthless and bloody land reform campaign (Cải Cách Ruộng Đất), and denouncing \"bourgeois and feudal\" tendencies in arts and literature. Many true patriots and devoted Communist revolutionaries in the Viet Minh suffered mistreatment or were even executed during these movements. Many others became disenchanted and left the Viet Minh. The United States became strongly opposed to Hồ Chí Minh. In the 1950s the government of Bảo Đại gained recognition by the United States and the United Kingdom.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1251668561, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "2d98b830857a707e9dfdc7665020441a80c46bfd41958142241124afdb027d6a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "France", "matched_aliases": ["France"], "query_id": "test1954", "question_hash": "db15f146260198b7edaf0bf7026d6b6ab86fb51f028ae3b0e05223c6d2b78216", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "fd796ec79dba0b64f4c68450785824f4c18a4180a14f77c99935e2b215399556", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 670328309, "similarity": 0.5283528352835284, "source_content_hash": "3564e087068fffe69d621dc6e0ef9fb44c9fa80176902b6a33dea9fa54e4eede", "source_hash": "58d454196fffba7ca98e711ea7be9447f1536b8c31f29e3e8a04d398674f79ec", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "5a8f66e68da2953f47c0a173b760217bf912366be678538c85fbc41dd4836a72", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc68619", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Wal-Mart Stores, Inc., doing business as Walmart, is an American multinational retail corporation that operates a chain of hypermarkets, discount department stores, and grocery stores. Headquartered in Bentonville, Arkansas, the company was founded by Sam Walton in 1962 and incorporated on October 31, 1969. It also owns and operates Sam's Club retail warehouses. As of October 31, 2017, Walmart has 11,703 stores and clubs in 28 countries, operating under 59 different names. The company operates under the name Walmart in the United States and Canada, as Walmart de México y Centroamérica in Mexico and Central America, as Asda in the United Kingdom, as the Seiyu Group in Japan, and as Best Price in India. It has wholly owned operations in Argentina, Chile, Brazil, and Canada.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 564981535, "similarity": 0.9786432160804021, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "b1e17af36e7e6f6d8a4009495772f0f03cb839076d8cb3519b13365c8fcde37f", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "multinational retail corporation", "matched_aliases": ["multinational retail corporation"], "query_id": "test1955", "question_hash": "69d1722ee4d52bf447f5a48d856890426e0e2f72e9f0e166017f92ca6f2b4f10", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4e75ca8a16cf5e92c0492fefab664405842d2a36091848a9c22dcc674d4c1509", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1919071760, "similarity": 0.43405443126308446, "source_content_hash": "03fe85f5da8dc0a330c80885704017368a4d76ad108057ed0723b83ab6bf850f", "source_hash": "f6bddfcbb5ae16c1b36754dc4977e890cbc9093dce119d96f657e7bf7caf13ec", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "2b3b8662dfaa1c1c53c227de0e280fb45b0cb102f8948a920f13e874d0c100a0", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "