{"doc_id": "doc69326", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "\"Does He Love You\" is a song written by Sandy Knox and Billy Stritch, and recorded as a duet by American country music artists Reba McEntire and Linda Davis. It was released in August 1993 as the first single from Reba's album Greatest Hits Volume Two. It is one of country music's several songs about a love triangle.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1265284165, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "4ff8e255a80bf5a49a626168d75408304dc95e7a7d6f9ce5fe664fc3f667705c", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Linda Davis", "matched_aliases": ["Linda Davis"], "query_id": "test1977", "question_hash": "c0bc7ed4314a2ae6418c9a4013e69f34a50426b119584d10fdd8743cd724fe0e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "c7dbb4f05089d77a844562362be51a366280dae03ebe44d0426d95d9e01fccf5", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 989944177, "similarity": 0.5397727272727273, "source_content_hash": "897d4571572ce831ccfdcb34cc6d0c6ff78fd21a03e8e32763f1c94db93ce39f", "source_hash": "e1e0e6d585f3fae3a6c04684c2f5579b7f2793e18274079369b2588fc96a4471", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "21a27c8f5153941ac469c486b20061521f48bf7275ca2a0ecf27ed7e31eddd7b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc69384", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Accounts receivable is a legally enforceable claim for payment held by a business for goods supplied and/or services rendered that customers/clients have ordered but not paid for. These are generally in the form of invoices raised by a business and delivered to the customer for payment within an agreed time frame. Accounts receivable is shown in a balance sheet as an asset. It is one of a series of accounting transactions dealing with the billing of a customer for goods and services that the customer has ordered. These may be distinguished from notes receivable, which are debts created through formal legal instruments called promissory notes.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 272188536, "similarity": 0.9954058192955589, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "55fe98888bae8e276b269d58424c587efb583dbe82931f5b2a35be755de3c93c", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "invoices", "matched_aliases": ["invoices"], "query_id": "test1979", "question_hash": "47870d476aa85c4892809aa03da9027d306a01bbcbfa9d3209237cd60856158e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "144c204aba7c284299d913622ebb7439cf8477635d31095668ded99770e872cc", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2608190, "similarity": 0.19345859429366735, "source_content_hash": "601c6d731bfa4e6136f3eed032b634bfd3c8729e73ec0a7bc0447bcff7a9695b", "source_hash": "8d8d9ea351aec47bc837f3e042930dade0b74d792152073b1a77be61107b3d4e", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "35c19a93c038a99afb2db08cf3846baa2e2f7facdb9e10a44dd6c4ac294a3100", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc69447", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the film The Lost City of Z, Murray survives and, in front of the RGS trustees, accuses Fawcett of abandoning him in the jungle. Fawcett elects to resign from the society rather than apologize. World War I breaks out in Europe, and Fawcett goes to France to fight. Manley dies in the trenches at the Battle of the Somme, and Fawcett is temporarily blinded in a chlorine gas attack. Jack, Fawcett's eldest son—who had long accused Fawcett of abandoning the family—reconciles with his father as he recovers.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1674986147, "similarity": 0.967479674796748, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "830331e156dd21a144ee6afa98625f0153b23fc1daa103240bc46940a2fc53f3", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Manley", "matched_aliases": ["Manley"], "query_id": "test1981", "question_hash": "6e4e429699727de5e46497097955d1cdcdb2ea92e3aea4e04fc3e2936bb43fbe", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "15cbb906780776cdcdb0631abaf04c4a1a8d0b7bc96d0e3474e95a7270ef0bcc", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 64950999, "similarity": 0.38863976083707025, "source_content_hash": "e49a1acdd3335820cd8fbd765aa091e1b0102b21c18c352290e446ae854a09e4", "source_hash": "d81aaac2761f5002a67fe880ac9c870e009de9ee6de4f01715606c44a60625b6", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "580753d131df4cb60416be280fa43bf1af574243ec1493582e832872036a5c7b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc69547", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Hydrogen peroxide is formed in human and animals as a short-lived product in biochemical processes and is toxic to cells. The toxicity is due to oxidation of proteins, membrane lipids and DNA by the peroxide ions.[28] The class of biological enzymes called SOD (superoxide dismutase) is developed in nearly all living cells as an important antioxidant agent. They promote the disproportionation of superoxide into oxygen and hydrogen peroxide, which is then rapidly decomposed by the enzyme catalase to oxygen and water.[29]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 2114100086, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "8ad7be811293776e4e9e97317f068fdb8ba03309bd04fbefa5a54dd4da9ec142", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "nearly all living cells", "matched_aliases": ["nearly all living cells"], "query_id": "test1984", "question_hash": "dee2ee8ea28f29e72ef7507012178b66cb47887d8d6aaa2c54ad3cc2efa57504", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "e9673e7abc5b2dbbb202ff551b16ff3c93b73bf4c2b3994db579848cae03fc6e", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 78121639, "similarity": 0.08436213991769548, "source_content_hash": "a4e20e7ecf4756ce33cd44892abfb95b11a44d05a138d7b6f35849fd9f75aaaa", "source_hash": "ddbe15fd56f72048946b5c993320dc03b29af6219b35a1dc08db21ea51164f4d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a13d1e51be650bf2838d04cead5672bcf334b13a6f85be75aef5d663d623075e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc69585", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Data Protection Act 1998 (c 29) is a United Kingdom Act of Parliament designed to protect personal data stored on computers or in an organised paper filing system. It follows the EU Data Protection Directive 1995 protection, processing and movement of data. Individuals have legal rights to control information about themselves. Most of the Act does not apply to domestic use,[1] for example keeping a personal address book. Anyone holding personal data for other purposes is legally obliged to comply with this Act, subject to some exemptions. The Act defines eight data protection principles to ensure that information is processed lawfully.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1159568109, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "d72342420efb175ad0a26ec1163e867eb45eb728576b930911441cb39b362093", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "The Data Protection Act 1998", "matched_aliases": ["The Data Protection Act 1998"], "query_id": "test1985", "question_hash": "437827e595ae21418b8b84829c11500dac1445c95ce01781125c0b9381baae8b", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "f5fdd74a02fccc477bab34a361558972765d6edce9db758d343f6107e99cea9d", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 456490663, "similarity": 0.26666666666666666, "source_content_hash": "10bef2c17110fd81a46102a44e710d60c3850e74f23288f74cb410f00f5b0cf8", "source_hash": "81c07048792f6facebb0ad8c6a660f0618853171968fa9b4943c7743c3a783e5", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "7adca07b5597d1724a19f25b1df876d20857972114d0eb89ec1efb949a99aaec", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc69611", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The London terminus for the Eurostar is St Pancras International, the other British calling points being Ebbsfleet International and Ashford International in Kent. Intermediate calling points in France are Calais-Fréthun and Lille-Europe, with trains to Paris terminating at Gare du Nord. Trains to Belgium terminate at Midi/Zuid station in Brussels. The only intermediate calling point in the Netherlands is Rotterdam Centraal, with trains terminating at Amsterdam Centraal. In addition, there are limited services from London to Disneyland Paris at Marne-la-Vallée – Chessy, direct services to southern France (Lyon, Avignon and Marseille) from May to September[1] (launched on 1 May 2015), and seasonal direct services to the French Alps in winter (December to April).", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1347610639, "similarity": 0.9888524590163934, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "aed9320f894b28b283151ee45b0a1d8f6cd9195c12575ecb0e8ab276f61009ad", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "St Pancras International", "matched_aliases": ["St Pancras International"], "query_id": "test1986", "question_hash": "a02c0623ff638666eb0459a80edfda9adc2fc932c129eb083bb579694576501b", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "ff89a2afe821b26c47d0f83eac9fbc25536463061701b520c196ce2e8453de31", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 21928669, "similarity": 0.15609756097560976, "source_content_hash": "268e9c11fc30e3a8f10d56f2f4cdcbdfd7d1222ad78a79d9025f2f84841253ba", "source_hash": "03f622830f7dbddfdeade25fa1a836c9c80e2c2f42358c7c820e61f0be9688dc", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "1260e2635bd3d95620482a6585477875edfdaa09c5f2a13ec91fcf9e2ae2bf3b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
