{"doc_id": "doc70511", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The spirit transports Scrooge around the city, showing him scenes of festivity and also deprivation that are happening as they watch, sprinkling a little warmth from his torch as he travels. Amongst the visits are Scrooge's nephew, and the family of his impoverished clerk, Bob Cratchit. Scrooge takes an interest in Cratchit's desperately-ill son, Tiny Tim, and asks the Ghost if Tim will live. The Ghost first states that \"If these shadows remain unaltered by the Future, the child will die,\" and then – quick to use Scrooge's past heartless comments to two charitable solicitors against him – states, \"What then? If he be like to die, he had better do it, and decrease the surplus population.\" The spirit then warns Scrooge to \"forebear that wicked tongue until you have discovered for yourself what the surplus is, and where it is.\" and chillingly tells him \"It may be, that in the sight of heaven, you are more worthless and less fit to live than MILLIONS like this poor man's child.\"", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 804594771, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "dbec8cb5bfb064768136826786ca065643335eab2c779bc5face49cad90f891e", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "warmth", "matched_aliases": ["warmth", "a little warmth"], "query_id": "test2014", "question_hash": "60d417a4092aee9fd0a64cc85f18d4d5c4826b0564dafd7e01ae287ef9c98671", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "d24d5880322c375433ead145d38bf15d3e4ca228607e631a6e0e19c1b4bc0885", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1815882723, "similarity": 0.17676486937187327, "source_content_hash": "d7e1bfd8de25febed27a3c9591c3c8c71e9d18f13ddf15e8180ce775f0b43349", "source_hash": "a37f16482deec2778ff311879f01130749ece422d971c298681cae8b89406cd6", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "46334ff10be603473ca1822fbb32e3be2058d9b4ae430e775fe43a64ecf823f7", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc70686", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Lupus Foundation of America (LFA), founded in 1977, is a national voluntary health organization based in Washington, D.C. with a network of chapters, offices and support groups located in communities throughout the United States. The Foundation is devoted to solving the mystery of lupus, one of the world's cruelest, most unpredictable and devastating diseases, while giving caring support to those who suffer from its brutal impact. Its mission is to improve the quality of life for all people affected by lupus through programs of research, education, support and advocacy.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1374425468, "similarity": 0.9965576592082617, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "585af49d090fbb6d9f0cb99f3e6d2e2d5aa4c73c0c5429e8b72138e297da4fb1", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "1977", "matched_aliases": ["1977"], "query_id": "test2022", "question_hash": "a4045f5c91d5c842bf7e8fce6cb6b07358f0ff092b25fbe410ba80b1a2d9c53e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "6cf7c97fb5ca910a7c5bdfee2626477e917068878b56f16ec53b915bc4432fb6", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 969042417, "similarity": 0.09486931268151017, "source_content_hash": "ae547c4bf88064d0ca7c577a70613989db02b7dedd247876aadc9ffdbec12f5a", "source_hash": "3f97da1d65a375d947a5550e7fbc942a80f43698f22fe6bff86f38c1156a130e", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "34d515545aa340878931bc5902f3c76c4a3c9d09afe7315e04af60763de11b97", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e4032315