{"doc_id": "doc71691", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Gibraltar, a British Overseas Territory located at the southern tip of the Iberian Peninsula, is the subject of an irredentist territorial claim by Spain. It was captured in 1704 during the War of the Spanish Succession (1701–1714). The Spanish Crown formally ceded the territory in perpetuity to the British Crown in 1713, under Article X of the Treaty of Utrecht. Spain later attempted to recapture the territory during the thirteenth siege (1727) and the Great siege (1779–1783). British sovereignty over Gibraltar was confirmed in later treaties signed in Seville (1729) and the Treaty of Paris (1783).", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1848636631, "similarity": 0.9991755976916735, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "700a74cc804a5dfa635c92d6c8399568e0afe2b24326bd94f28423a013266379", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Gibraltar", "matched_aliases": ["Gibraltar"], "query_id": "test2059", "question_hash": "e3be8e58cceaf473e5fa22b47bb24cbd286f27811cf5bdf8188e26b9fbf21e72", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "b5662fddc80042a07c583f616afd8b47b407cd65c775974baa4d3698278ecac8", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1398742564, "similarity": 0.17216411906677392, "source_content_hash": "24c9275ba3bcb61ca40e0211c83c7a55fa4271c196c4d4c3fa0cd2f5a5a1c090", "source_hash": "4a2a54d54beccbd543e64b822e6b28b5e391c329ffae3456ed4e758c9aa8013b", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "d626b54464e5ffd9eee4c1f34705b6b742e5d6e7d80211326a7d6b0cc98ee518", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc71692", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Reclamation of the territory became government policy under the regime of the dictator General Franco and has remained in place under successive governments following the Spanish transition to democracy. The Gibraltarians themselves reject any such claim and no political party or pressure group in Gibraltar supports union with Spain. In a referendum in 2002 the people of Gibraltar rejected a joint sovereignty proposal on which Spain and the United Kingdom were said to have reached \"broad agreement\".[1][2] The British Government has stated that it would \"never ... enter into an agreement on sovereignty without the agreement of the Government of Gibraltar and their people\".[3] The British Government now refuses to discuss sovereignty without the consent of the Gibraltarians.[4]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1982681095, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "c28aa561e5d22f3a5ccd0998ab8fa0c8b6d30f6c93d497674d8318bb498be901", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Gibraltar", "matched_aliases": ["Gibraltar"], "query_id": "test2059", "question_hash": "e3be8e58cceaf473e5fa22b47bb24cbd286f27811cf5bdf8188e26b9fbf21e72", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "85aaf696605a4caa4f8f92cd4fdf1770ef59aed666dc3a575a0674fe0dce5130", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1229037230, "similarity": 0.27892030848329047, "source_content_hash": "502c7922ea75420d105e9303833db3844bd142703e41b379b7eb81c962bf6581", "source_hash": "032d832860512eb2918eddfccb661ff38198e351c1d70036f8acb58aa9d441e9", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "0cd9d11a343ee7b7624eb16267a7fe27aa5465282e2eda662a08a872aca14365", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc71700", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Gibraltar was given the Gibraltar Constitution Order 2006 by Britain which established a form of government whereby the Governor of Gibraltar is responsible for the conduct of external affairs, defence, internal security and for certain appointments to public office, and the Government of Gibraltar is made responsible for all other matters. The UK believes that as an independent territory, recognised by the United Nations Gibraltar enjoys the individual and collective rights that are set out in the 2006 constitution and the right of self-determination. Spain disputes the legality of the constitution and claims that it does not change the position of Gibraltar as a colony of the UK with only the UK empowered to discuss Gibraltar matters on the international scene.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 233059805, "similarity": 0.9948519948519948, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "af699f61b02a939ea3792586b5d219202809b94602d2c21a09fe739cc0b6f358", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Gibraltar", "matched_aliases": ["Gibraltar"], "query_id": "test2059", "question_hash": "e3be8e58cceaf473e5fa22b47bb24cbd286f27811cf5bdf8188e26b9fbf21e72", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "03fdfbcd3877991c04b16dab6752956fc4d906a3dc235bddfcdc276e2adb1e19", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1498832617, "similarity": 0.21637866265965439, "source_content_hash": "1e9643e358995417871a6c1efc2bc265220921b5e624178f788d5a12cc0c6949", "source_hash": "022a745f3e1d125c722ab28d253b4376cef8a4d3d82a98a11677f905d2ed67d8", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6cf8ccf7468c854efcfc88e78abcfd37207fd419bad4938d581ced5c2c7257ec", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc71790", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Thomas Mundy Peterson (October 6, 1824 â February 4, 1904) of Perth Amboy, New Jersey was the first African-American to vote in an election under the just-enacted provisions of the 15th Amendment to the United States Constitution. His vote was cast on March 31, 1870.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 127701271, "similarity": 0.9816176470588235, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "4510aff5603e3f97cb4fbf329bd28b2287e32086fcab664b9e381bd6906b9de2", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Thomas Mundy Peterson", "matched_aliases": ["Thomas Mundy Peterson"], "query_id": "test2060", "question_hash": "2e85b8eee3355e9ef26f27ab90fbec860810bfb489f54f1dff0f60e6c4b7f9a4", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "873274cc525a546398709b444b69c194199d50d1dedd72acdcde020f2f5a6cf8", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 381192190, "similarity": 0.22393822393822393, "source_content_hash": "73bdc7fcab1bfcd762df5f48522cd3ae93321f7ac0eb6461ee137dfa1376b399", "source_hash": "4d6f5d4179a6efefa8f384270c0ca3e11237b25b670668f7b5b048ae5393e48b", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "b9590ed9f8cb2188e7678ead81e2db4ad2c8d35c935f07fa0c3c33b467e7c4bf", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc71815", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The East India Company received a Royal Charter from Queen Elizabeth I on 31 December 1600, coming relatively late to trade in the Indies. Before them the Portuguese Estado da India had traded there for much of the 16th century and the first of half a dozen Dutch Companies sailed to trade there from 1595, which amalgamated in March 1602 into the United East Indies Company (VOC), which introduced the first permanent joint stock from 1612 (meaning investment into shares did not need to be returned, but could be traded on a stock exchange). Wealthy merchants and aristocrats owned the EIC's shares.[4] Initially the government owned no shares and had only indirect control until 1657 when permanent joint stock was established.[5]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 49819732, "similarity": 0.9924398625429554, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "4fb0e97b68c65d16156aa65f873b75a075fc06c4feba901a67ff1a02f5e212c9", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "31 December 1600", "matched_aliases": ["31 December 1600"], "query_id": "test2062", "question_hash": "4a5892747f3d95c4d821c303015000655c1ba3a6eec283458412e5d0fa96280e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "e643b17702370790facf52564b82d12ec5f52d747c15f2c3b4ed4e6b984e95ef", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1063136574, "similarity": 0.373806275579809, "source_content_hash": "9a785347e34399686106862cd366a4a94e5aebb3a572b807f1e3f36bd7c6a272", "source_hash": "c0dcf229015f352e01668fbd4a21bc40932581605ca4bb226b284b82fc26f6c8", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "14b368675c4ed8e9b5757d3f7858e13f00e9d92fba1a74505161c4b2d69ca614", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null