{"doc_id": "doc76206", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Since 1947, there have been eight Chief Ministers of West Bengal. The first was Prafulla Chandra Ghosh of the Indian National Congress, who was succeeded by his party-mates Dr Bidhan Chandra Roy and Prafulla Chandra Sen. A decade of instability followed, marred by fractious coalition governments and frequent impositions of President's rule. The instability ended with 1977 election victory of the Communist Party of India (Marxist) (CPM). Headed by Jyoti Basu, the CPM-led Left Front government was in office for over 23 years (1977â€“2000). Left rule in West Bengal continued for another 10 years under Buddhadeb Bhattacharya, before its defeat in the 2011 election by the Trinamool Congress. Appointed on 20 May 2011, Trinamool leader Mamata Banerjee is the current incumbent, the state's first woman chief minister.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1985412935, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "b088b753cdf34b80a5ace03f28ec6162aca80c1c0186c911c81d0ae5fe664ee8", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Prafulla Chandra Ghosh", "matched_aliases": ["Prafulla Chandra Ghosh"], "query_id": "test2185", "question_hash": "575a2abf64e1557af602027e93349262b355ded0e418f92f0524cf01da497520", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "0afe9d2c04cdd9b322faddabb21238bb802df3aab7303b3aa9216d1665595e23", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1842530984, "similarity": 0.5052754982415005, "source_content_hash": "2a4157df65507b90c1b2f355eaf90f6eedbd4470d6901f024cc759dc0cb8ae07", "source_hash": "be52196ecb3fb7802a1c76330eaa35f31155d6b8203bf2ae4e1506d8275ac33d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ab53d2315154f629c6c1c77040e39531bfc0c13f4e51e7a273c75eae1d86ed80", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc76237", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Hunger Games is a 2008 dystopian novel by the American writer Suzanne Collins. It is written in the voice of 16-year-old Katniss Everdeen, who lives in the future, post-apocalyptic nation of Panem in North America. The Capitol, a highly advanced metropolis, exercises political control over the rest of the nation. The Hunger Games is an annual event in which one boy and one girl aged 12–18 from each of the twelve districts surrounding the Capitol are selected by lottery to compete in a televised battle to the death.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1288844081, "similarity": 0.9980916030534351, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "2a96cf3d5e151e8f5f24ee77f0290f93ae0b874a7fadf282479dc80e286cb9ec", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "September 14, 2008", "matched_aliases": ["2008"], "query_id": "test2189", "question_hash": "e01c84864f3c7a54daa7ef4f0ef7ab08e6de9271a5146a18534cb9b7935b0b48", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "42eaad9cb2cdc330d362457ae87377fc71a1613ba7394313002553c728727893", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 758707609, "similarity": 0.4298507462686567, "source_content_hash": "367d53310687c7dac06bc6677d07ac319a78c08113840f182add263661f079ae", "source_hash": "43deea7912660165bd73049f274b0c317c4d10b5143e3f779b43b6af74380333", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "bcff65b6021c1e5044eb85bde385feed3203ed237544b629e07117075991e631", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc76239", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Hunger Games was first published in hardcover on September 14, 2008, by Scholastic, featuring a cover designed by Tim O'Brien. It has since been released in paperback and also as an audiobook and ebook. After an initial print of 200,000, the book had sold 800,000 copies by February 2010. Since its release, The Hunger Games has been translated into 26 languages, and publishing rights have been sold in 38 territories. The novel is the first in The Hunger Games trilogy, followed by Catching Fire (2009) and Mockingjay (2010). A film adaptation, directed by Gary Ross and co-written and co-produced by Collins herself, was released in 2012.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 985796616, "similarity": 0.9976762199845082, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "41bfbe676361bb270fec100de31efbae45e84154b6aad65f69c06fed64c76d42", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "September 14, 2008", "matched_aliases": ["2008"], "query_id": "test2189", "question_hash": "e01c84864f3c7a54daa7ef4f0ef7ab08e6de9271a5146a18534cb9b7935b0b48", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "50ccbfcff0ed851d8251372565a436371ae049d7a055eb493d3266a63f7d0e1e", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 747354298, "similarity": 0.18376068376068377, "source_content_hash": "3334ea7120d4f803bc06c88c821d7e803bea5c54ce81b4feed5b1293e4d5e78f", "source_hash": "205a42c85817ce077ae0a339c98fe7da2c0c726985a285040ceb4720352055e1", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "c557be1be99189cc8903856a78c643ae2ec0985dd6159315891e5bff18d9cfee", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerabi