{"doc_id": "doc84117", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Thank You for Your Service is a 2017 American biographical war drama film written and directed by Jason Hall, in his directorial debut, based on the 2013 non-fiction book of the same name by David Finkel. Finkel, a Washington Post reporter, wrote about veterans of the 2nd Battalion, 16th Infantry Regiment returning to the vicinity of Fort Riley, Kansas, following a 15-month deployment in Iraq in 2007. The film is about posttraumatic stress disorder (PTSD), depicting U.S. soldiers who try to adjust to civilian life, and stars Miles Teller, Haley Bennett, Beulah Koale, Amy Schumer and Scott Haze. A new Bruce Springsteen song, \"Freedom Cadence\", was written specifically for the closing credits.[4]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1625331097, "similarity": 0.9758179231863442, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "7f50aaebd7f26285d18aae8b7e1fe6db0d7dcccb97e0a34ca38c5e770bd6b515", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Kansas", "matched_aliases": ["Kansas", "Fort Riley, Kansas"], "query_id": "test2439", "question_hash": "d629bd00a4c3418d9c1cde722c3fc326660f62310ea806817ea82cdb5060d4d2", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "e6e41d87739efeb423aaf22273ca22ede46f8a48e20b06edd368530acfd646f8", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 371397076, "similarity": 0.5643835616438356, "source_content_hash": "3fe66bacc3d10a5bdf64f0912aa7a7f095f3890388733b2f623573978bdd1716", "source_hash": "a9ec5cf97cdcfb28729ad95927591dcceb977b115e7b044ee0cff65a4949c965", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "60b5d3128d555ad3efbf917d1c8b1d4b87910634e4bf5837f77dd5bf5bb22ab9", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc84119", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "After a harrowing 15-month combat experience in Iraq, the much-decorated Adam Schumann (Miles Teller) returns home to Kansas and a loving wife, Saskia (Haley Bennett). Adam and Saskia have two young children, a daughter and infant son born while Adam was still overseas. Adam suffers from PTSD as manifest by nightmares and frequent flashbacks for which his wife convinces him to seek help from an overburdened Department of Veterans Affairs. He also receives solace from two Iraq buddies living nearby, an American Samoan, Solo Aeiti (Beulah Koale), and Billy Waller (Joe Cole), who commits suicide in front of his fiancée (Erin Darke) after discovering she has taken all his money and their child and left him.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 507073111, "similarity": 0.9978947368421053, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "70dd04960da3a3816e9ece0049f56bc62cad9c322047999b18c24848bfbc9257", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Kansas", "matched_aliases": ["Kansas"], "query_id": "test2439", "question_hash": "d629bd00a4c3418d9c1cde722c3fc326660f62310ea806817ea82cdb5060d4d2", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "c2853bb66a308634d336d65066c8987ac84091f9896f04b1342e8f4ea89d1510", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2092827051, "similarity": 0.29456066945606696, "source_content_hash": "a90e6ce5726813e8a3adb3650d082e6cf2dc9ea874291c33206bedfd0c8f6fbd", "source_hash": "6c3eb1d0c44ec8b59cfd095d3462e9fac3e6d61b106b5c4c4043eeb69946a23f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6384349d835830d0e2012e31a51d1375c937501ca7804cb6d0eb10cfae63c549", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage":