{"doc_id": "doc99042", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Texhoma is a town in Texas County, Oklahoma, United States. The population was 926 at the 2010 census. Texhoma is a divided city with the Texasâ€“Oklahoma state border separating the town from Texhoma, Texas. The name of the town is a portmanteau of Texas and Oklahoma.[1] Founded around the Rock Island Railroad laying tracks through the area, much of the town's local economy is from ranching and livestock.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1351112925, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "cfc06171ac299a8e5a6ac25df020b2bf9eb6385498c29d4639e1df16da11d05b", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Texhoma", "matched_aliases": ["Texhoma"], "query_id": "test2899", "question_hash": "f3ee5959025d993cf03753fb4b12d31fc0af7181aecad23c9caa1669bf86c6af", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "f498c3094bda74124358af0c7084f582bab79e59979f7e047a24ca6bd44eb871", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 877941713, "similarity": 0.09201623815967523, "source_content_hash": "f53320f302ae7c823ea4b156220a365d827033dc0908edbe8a08376640966d4b", "source_hash": "9d641ae69c0b90b5fb8f81606348ca0a84a988c01432308d0b5b82902ba75760", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "51e1f9f39f92f815629237c9903754f2269ef4cf4a8b02d90714624373f0e180", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc99093", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [], "fingerprint": "c3de1b7143ed571ed6f6c51525a614b8a4b0b500e6f65e8fe50cefc08392e668", "generation_attempts": 1, "gold_answer": "Arousal regulation", "matched_aliases": ["Arousal regulation"], "query_id": "test2900", "question_hash": "3c28deb526e15924af7487b82241024444b43c0b60759a13fcf68f39ae24b690", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "f804d68513a243e0915fc178a181a6499a4fc8210a1089aebe99c63f05c2e653", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1794120096, "similarity": 0.22516964836520667, "source_content_hash": "8d9c9dff47c9acb4e8d347f87443778f6c2c0d35066fc5a53610a8adb93341cd", "source_hash": "f40aa82540fea1c729c1c32d881cd59970faf3893c899d7b252754beb933e16a", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.3, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a34276a603bc0a8a56267ad964eb863e2e6cb71001edd02c9d549f7c05b98665", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc99105", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the 1920s, Sean Thornton (John Wayne), an Irish-born American from Pittsburgh, travels to Ireland to reclaim his family's farm and his birthplace in Inisfree. He meets and falls in love with the fiery Mary Kate Danaher (Maureen O'Hara), the sister of the bullying, loud-mouthed landowner Squire \"Red\" Will Danaher (Victor McLaglen). Danaher, who had wanted the farm himself, is angry that the Widow Tillane (angered by Danaher's admission that he had discussed her in the local pub) accepts Sean's bid, and retaliates by refusing consent for his sister to marry. Several town locals, including the Catholic priest, Father Lonergan (Ward Bond) and the village matchmaker (and bookmaker) Michaleen Oge Flynn (Barry Fitzgerald), conspire to trick him into believing that the wealthy Widow Tillane (Mildred Natwick) wants to marry him, but only if Mary Kate is no longer living in his house. After learning the truth on Sean and Mary Kate's wedding day, an enraged Will refuses to give his sister her dowry which is made up of a large sum of money and her family possessions passed down from her mother.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 373976358, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In the 1920s, Sean Thornton (John Wayne), an Irish-born American from Pittsburgh, travels to Ireland to reclaim his family's farm and his birthplace in Inisfree. He meets and falls in love with the fiery Mary Kate Danaher (Maureen O'Hara), the sister of the bullying, loud-mouthed landowner Squire \"Red\" Will Danaher (Victor McLaglen). Danaher, who had wanted the farm himself, is angry that the Widow Tillane (angered by Danaher's admission that he had discussed her in the local pub) accepts Sean's bid, and retaliates by refusing consent for his sister to marry. Several town locals, including the Catholic priest, Father Lonergan (Ward Bond) and the village matchmaker (and bookmaker) Michaleen Oge Flynn (Barry Fitzgerald), conspire to trick him into believing that the wealthy Widow Tillane (Mildred Natwick) wants to marry him, but only if Mary Kate is no longer living in his house. After learning the truth on Sean and Mary Kate's wedding day, an enraged Will refuses to give his sister her dowry which is made up of a large sum of money and her family possessions passed down from her mother.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1869323462, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "46ed6a080963341e03bcf69de05d6ec4dba5fa773768c7c7ddaa2a47a3697ae9", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "the 1920s", "matched_aliases": ["the 1920s", "In the 1920s"], "query_id": "test2901", "question_hash": "e7f8187e77363d4a17cc9eec4a5fd5f190faed582c305e0b53ab2bb44f033d09", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "3707d22d80c6e161b1124c5c864e31a1611d617871280a48576f601db8d09093", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1305462386, "similarity": 0.06559263521288838, "source_content_hash": "47191dc99e528f2363696bee009a4035107aefb0c2bdf35db083be8b2e3ecec7", "source_hash": "78ed8a0a65e27ce5b56e3ba886aa881c38a21836707ec841653f51743e240e90", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "9a894ec1b988026ea47e122573c5ecd76fcc9d410b54cefe2dab88cc10d4ab42", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc99135", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "A Bend in the Road\nIs Jonah's second grade teacher. She used to live at Baltimore but moved to New Bern in the hope of starting over after a really difficult divorce. She was not able to have children which was the reason why her marriage didn't work. Due to her kindness she offered to tutor Jonah after school. She loved Miles and enjoyed spending times with Jonah. After she discovered that her brother, Brian, was Missy's killer she was torn apart.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 589316394, "similarity": 0.9785310734463277, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "03159dcbfd6a2f0728ee757feb631f601fce440cc19f110f26539bf24f3f147d", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Brian", "matched_aliases": ["Brian"], "query_id": "test2902", "question_hash": "27e89234e00900e61d30cf7033203ae26159274b8d6e02ed284262e7e0f3d115", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "1dcd8e5491467e04a39b8631a4c9e0ece5f48baa39ff52d6b83749ac0b460e46", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 432409940, "similarity": 0.09896907216494845, "source_content_hash": "0f50c8d3045d0af088f2729d5876021be7a13b982987f7361ef6c287431f7df9", "source_hash": "dbf6f08ba9d918e0b778687a2afce66f685da96ebcbffb29aa0be5beba05cda1", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "b7321e651f2e17d272d8c29fc02be4a765e12e408666ce7022830228b95a8307", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc99137", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "At the beginning of the story the killer is an unknown person. Miles was always obsessed with finding an answer so when someone told him that Otis Timson bragged about killing Missy he did not think twice and tried to arrest him. Eventually, Sarah's brother, Brian, tells her that he was the killer but explains that everything was an accident. Sarah thinks about how to tell Miles and when she finally does Miles is furious and wants to punish Brian. After hearing Brian's version of the story he went back to the crime scene and discovered that Brian's story might be true. He later followed Brian to the cemetery and made him promise that he would do something important with his life and eventually lets him go free. Brian later became an emergency room physician and had saved six lives.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1374494037, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "0cc29982e4630ea1037b4f0c722f312ff026fc14ecb5f99a63e598acd133485e", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Brian", "matched_aliases": ["Brian", "Sarah's brother, Brian"], "query_id": "test2902", "question_hash": "27e89234e00900e61d30cf7033203ae26159274b8d6e02ed284262e7e0f3d115", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "28c6d5154f157264259bed3043d33d14d656fb7ff485716f0582b4a3527fc051", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 509179635, "similarity": 0.019008825526137134, "source_content_hash": "286b5a4ad5c1eb0b44fdbac065de73a701ca2af5903d6609d5e99abdc680e8e5", "source_hash": "97e0884da3bcb4b7d48d79f995410b5c33cd6b52ccffabc267a5ed8b4513fd32", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "0aa1fbbcca329ef0a0aed54d1db28fd7bbd98095c2517f90bead4df5e06b2cbc", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mod