{"doc_id": "doc105367", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Singer-songwriters Dan Bern and Mike Viola (of the Candy Butchers) wrote most of the film's songs, including \"There's a Change a Happenin'\", \"Mulatto\", \"A Life Without You (Is No Life at All)\", \"Beautiful Ride\" and \"Hole in My Pants\". Charlie Wadhams wrote the song \"Let's Duet\". Marshall Crenshaw wrote the title song, and Van Dyke Parks penned the Brian Wilson-esque 1960s-styled psychedelic jam \"Black Sheep\" (the recording session seems to be a specific parody of Wilson's Smile album sessions, on which Van Dyke Parks worked). Antonio Ortiz wrote \"Take My Hand\". A number of critics noted the unusually high quality of many of the individual songs on the soundtrack, how well they reflected the styles and times they were attempting to parody, and how well they stood on their own as quality compositions. The soundtrack was nominated for both a Grammy and Golden Globe Award and was nominated and won the Sierra Award for Best Song in a Motion Picture from the Las Vegas Film Critics Society. John C. Reilly sang on all the tracks and played guitar on most of them.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 743475718, "similarity": 0.9986013986013986, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "afa822009bac1029e56a1819ec0c00e34bc9d28ba2ddb1ce060b177ba7657787", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "John C. Reilly", "matched_aliases": ["John C. Reilly"], "query_id": "test3080", "question_hash": "bcf6e676037a4270800d1f66ae9e57cf8d2d633bc9f7ccb9773a374c19a7fcb2", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "b84edbddd7be823ea6ecb087630a3b9fb4945606a979c4aae1e87963d9cb1bb6", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2052221358, "similarity": 0.12214983713355049, "source_content_hash": "660d3918e8ce5adf4e610fdd93861601efefe3b9c1eb8712ace65f5e4f5e308d", "source_hash": "4c6a31099bc303ae2cfa06d3d2c8723ec749ab8276d0a4f604ece73a056f7ca5", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "237a29a29611debd7b5557b15cd3aec909988b0ef6ee5a52248fb6be4d58a912", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
