{"doc_id": "doc106918", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "As the series progresses, Tony eventually manages to reconcile with Michelle and resumes his relationship with her. In the final episode, \"Everyone\", Tony receives grades better than all his friends in A-Levels; 3 As and a B. He also helps Sid steal Chris' coffin and later return it. Tony intends to go Cardiff University, while Michelle intends to go to University of York. Tony also sees Sid, who is leaving to find Cassie in New York. As Sid leaves, Tony is unable to hold back his tears. At the end of the episode, Tony and Michelle discuss their relationship and whether or not they will continue their relationship in university or say goodbye forever remains ambiguous to the audience. Nonetheless, they part on good terms.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1314500494, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "c81299147e1df6847acd3f529a039d6eed4c0043598d1afd3434cb88136fcc28", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Michelle", "matched_aliases": ["Michelle"], "query_id": "test3127", "question_hash": "1984ab0a59568605d771a60b1658481e9a8a95a24c0cfcb8465b2fd86b0cdec0", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "cf27309dd45764890e6d74147cb9248f8baac4b6c549ba12197da77a2bb86f44", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 26554421, "similarity": 0.026845637583892617, "source_content_hash": "32ae1631ef7071ec2304150e132ac7d26599f9622d72d61ecd50a6e3bb76bc22", "source_hash": "1099f47ee2359f7d660598260432d316590c52bb6b319a83379556e0dab0bb7d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "8adaee833c4188bfeb3aea9948af9b6aefd36ef3673e0f190f7e43b918c47204", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": fals