{"doc_id": "doc107125", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Glycogen is the analogue of starch, a glucose polymer that functions as energy storage in plants. It has a structure similar to amylopectin (a component of starch), but is more extensively branched and compact than starch. Both are white powders in their dry state. Glycogen is found in the form of granules in the cytosol/cytoplasm in many cell types, and plays an important role in the glucose cycle. Glycogen forms an energy reserve that can be quickly mobilized to meet a sudden need for glucose, but one that is less compact than the energy reserves of triglycerides (lipids).", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 954587695, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "f88af428409a3b9a08a94c3b2aa3416292f694772e678a55eb8b020837c0955a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "glucose", "matched_aliases": ["glucose"], "query_id": "test3138", "question_hash": "14001f348fe7c1a1c02bc150868944a6e846e58f9be579269400f26ffe4e9717", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "0dc8bc07c75501414beb767c6cdb96c3aeba3a719dc774397c7849cc8270ac40", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 436877054, "similarity": 0.04199475065616798, "source_content_hash": "2b7e69b598e7a2bfbfb24ef1b51f8f3ab5abdfe511b5fb0103a02344cd22183b", "source_hash": "0ff018e5dd6e879e0126df4149b310a28edcb7c3f3c70d05310813f1d6b91bd0", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "5597d51d77cd1bb243dbe3147668a5d2da5858eabf28eb695fb00c049637eaa8", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc107145", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The paper rapidly acquired a broad popularity, at one time having a readership of 20,000. Bhupendranath Dutt served as the editor of the newspaper till his arrest in 1907, although it also published articles from a number of noted Bengali revolutionaries including Barindra Kumar Ghosh and Aurobindo Ghosh. It faced prosecution a number of times by the British Indian government for publishing seditious articles. Bhupendranath Dutt was arrested in 1907 for publication of articles \"inciting violence against the Government of India\", for which he was sentenced to a year's rigorous imprisonment. The paper was ultimately forced to shut down in 1908, amidst financial ruins following the prosecutions, and after the passage of The Newspapers (Incitement to offences) act in June 1908 which made its position vulnerable.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1536406468, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "99e3a7b18a6f3b5cc0dd7636a16a7366525f0e3a4fd59630f1ddf0b839731577", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Bhupendranath Dutt", "matched_aliases": ["Bhupendranath Dutt"], "query_id": "test3139", "question_hash": "44820be39e431b9473432bc7f97a1b363b85ea17fe89bcde99e308b25d0f0c1f", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "738c851686ad63094c9f17a5d53b36f5433004c681128f2f73189924ee3c7768", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1423934118, "similarity": 0.3191489361702128, "source_content_hash": "fa050a48ecc4dae1784175466196507ae8671f59cd17db4293143dbd6ade172d", "source_hash": "fe48a5f2edf59a4e3dfe886237eb0ef853b6cfebdbe43a1263ae482b91334461", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "aeba2aa30c556021c5d2f68c9ba772154cc66f269765fd500d480912175d839e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
