{"doc_id": "doc111273", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Around the Horn premiered on November 4, 2002. From its premiere until January 2004, the show was hosted by Max Kellerman, who at the time was largely known strictly as a contributor to ESPN's Friday Night Fights. Kellerman departed from the network for Fox Sports and after the show tried out several replacements, current host Tony Reali was named the permanent host in February 2004. As of August 2017, Woody Paige has the most wins in the history of the show, with more than five hundred. Despite early negative reviews due to its argumentative formatting, the show has lasted more than fifteen years on the air, remaining a staple on ESPN.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1916023794, "similarity": 0.983206106870229, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "355ed3917ce8ea04184c6b3ebdde9fc6f07072388f0a37d611c26fe42e7e15d8", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Woody Paige", "matched_aliases": ["Woody Paige"], "query_id": "test3256", "question_hash": "fa06b0b4c9ea92acb6086d11d1f5485c1fd176e880dc367e57c34de364ca4ac8", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "efe28132f8fae89aea130f0113a25eb77bdce62a1c2a5560a86335d790df5544", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 702941249, "similarity": 0.1807465618860511, "source_content_hash": "703bb766f9b0ab0e0993c10abc7fead9687132003f457296dde038b5de2b7b21", "source_hash": "55a85b722a01682d7a1fa4f9fed72ea57e54ad18fc0f2249ef1428d36ea53edc", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "dccc8a21a4f41d370f9f4458eb53ccf0cc650de873eb581e5cd4fb9d91525436", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc111300", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Arsenal Football Club is a professional football club based in Islington, London, England, that plays in the Premier League, the top flight of English football. The club has won 13 League titles, a record 13 FA Cups, two League Cups, the League Centenary Trophy, 15 FA Community Shields, one UEFA Cup Winners' Cup and one Inter-Cities Fairs Cup. It is also the only English club to go a 38-match league season unbeaten, receiving the nickname The Invincibles, and a special gold Premier League trophy.[3]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1668305618, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "fd37676252a148c319ff1ec8eb2248be334c4c55ca87d46e86f87fac5da9d18d", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "13", "matched_aliases": ["13"], "query_id": "test3257", "question_hash": "ef3d14ed35a2ae06d8cd412d96033a464c8063496743762d7f4b7506108cc643", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "b4e3bdaf562fc30a01b02055e022b684b657c6ed3f9264167c811b28bcce335f", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 745632780, "similarity": 0.4621212121212121, "source_content_hash": "d8259979ff4af4ba7eb9e8e8288cac95edf8110eee2eef4ff66cf81b8b892001", "source_hash": "0f2dce02cea0d89adfe5a0834683680b25f4045eed8e97e4c228d6b7b70ea763", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "7794ed1c4bdc099cf8446a33a876c6b118cccbba5afd463010b6b970b3377c37", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc111345", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Arsenal's tally of 13 League Championships is the third highest in English football, after Manchester United (20) and Liverpool (18),[157] and they were the first club to reach a seventh and an eighth League Championship. As of May 2016, they are one of only six teams, the others being Manchester United, Blackburn Rovers, Chelsea, Manchester City and Leicester City, to have won the Premier League since its formation in 1992.[158]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1571033232, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "678b5e69d7b6e489869e4ac75cee9d97cab62712cc161aae02903ee40cc019f2", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "13", "matched_aliases": ["13"], "query_id": "test3257", "question_hash": "ef3d14ed35a2ae06d8cd412d96033a464c8063496743762d7f4b7506108cc643", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "ee376c0f7e00989bdaa8623df02a0c69ff090693fe5b02b706409397c075574d", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1306377855, "similarity": 0.3507214206437292, "source_content_hash": "2758bd5c07109307554d4522f60f9290b244105d5d5f71d8a40eea18ec0849f2", "source_hash": "8f8bf603ab984a992aeca6826cae2cf8ff3292db0934f38b9687d0661c606323", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "42c3516e84a35bd949bea4f02faec706a8b4633f3d3f6eb67db70df6da91227d", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
