{"doc_id": "doc116092", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the final fight of the movie *Real Steel*, the machine known as Zeus wins the match. Zeus starts the fight by knocking Atom down with its first punch, but Atom gets up, and Zeus continues its assault, knocking Atom down multiple times, but each time Atom gets back up, and eventually is able to land its first punch, a right uppercut. Atom survives the first round, stunning the audience. Ricky, who had made a bet with a friend of Charlie's of $100,000 that Atom would not last the round, tries to slip away, but is cornered by the fight's bookmakers. The two opponents go back and forth throughout the fight, Atom landing multiple punches but also getting knocked down many times, getting back up for each of them. Late in the fourth round, Atom's vocal-respond controls are damaged, forcing Charlie to use its \"shadow function\" to make it mimic his boxing skills. This, and the fact that Zeus starts running out of power from its constant offense, tip the odds in Atom's favor, forcing Zeus' programmer to manually control it, and Max and Bailey both watch Charlie doing what he was meant to do, and are touched by seeing him literally fighting for his son. Zeus gets a sound beating, once even hitting the ground and barely avoiding losing by knockout, but survives the final round and wins the match by the judges' decision. The technologically superior machine remains undefeated, but with the humiliation of being fought to a near-loss, to which Atom is hailed the \"People's Champion\".", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 40493460, "similarity": 0.9696760854583046, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "642fbb3d98b460cae1668c6e32903212590b6af7374e459df1eb03101945224e", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Zeus", "matched_aliases": ["Zeus"], "query_id": "test3408", "question_hash": "170dbd7ce1a2ebab2f11347d24406bbb9e72e9af212335490b27bb60df51