{"doc_id": "doc117121", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Armed conflict began in 1775. In 1776, the Second Continental Congress declared a new, independent nation: the United States of America. Led by General George Washington, it won the Revolutionary War with large support from France. The peace treaty of 1783 gave the new nation the land east of the Mississippi River (except Canada and Florida). The Articles of Confederation established a central government, but it was ineffectual at providing stability, as it could not collect taxes and had no executive officer. A convention in 1787 wrote a new Constitution that was adopted in 1789. In 1791, a Bill of Rights was added to guarantee inalienable rights. With Washington as the first president and Alexander Hamilton his chief adviser, a strong central government was created. Purchase of the Louisiana Territory from France in 1803 doubled the size of the United States. A second and final war with Britain was fought in 1812, which solidified national pride.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1392778136, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "ce2e66d83b776ef3f2501d0c8f78b31e0743c77055fd674564be9a41baca02df", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "1776", "matched_aliases": ["1776", "In 1776"], "query_id": "test3440", "question_hash": "d98511afe0f5f5f67f204de260a844c50ad7771fd5ae3b001bf320774045fb0b", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "26156fe910f7cb409e28447a8307f90b24d509686cdd9a85ccdb6f7b49919e89", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1424640251, "similarity": 0.14507772020725387, "source_content_hash": "ca63f453b2f8fdc6119ab3a7e32c8d5d677805abed3ba837d873554426370f37", "source_hash": "a539c00270f4ae01b367c4ed3ad27429d50d2efd1aa8a40d513d4200fdcbb7d8", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "f4850743332e380e26214cdf42a213b02fb452897ec8d2b922d9d473bd29c0b0", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc117174", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "On July 4, 1776, the Second Continental Congress, meeting in Philadelphia, declared the independence of \"the United States of America\" in the Declaration of Independence. July 4 is celebrated as the nation's birthday. Historian George Billias says:", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 412368076, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "5a4cfdebecfab08bdfc7da8bcec32c96d4a71234bc399a492938337a855e1760", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "1776", "matched_aliases": ["1776", "July 4, 1776"], "query_id": "test3440", "question_hash": "d98511afe0f5f5f67f204de260a844c50ad7771fd5ae3b001bf320774045fb0b", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "4d96b59792dd48dd2076e675251f606ed3fa712032890a03afea41f0a236691e", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1151397054, "similarity": 0.16905901116427433, "source_content_hash": "fa8f69f71e3ef04c94d0375fbd0897837c5b4ce5e0979fea4a55e928b3146565", "source_hash": "0ebe765258ce1684865fdc54b6f123c92114c80e1b5efd5f2bce2782610c053f", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "d56fdfce89eff396c6e2f3788135cfdca714ab41e3ed7228a6910aaf124c19a4", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc117567", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Throughout the novel, Junior shares his dreams with the readers. In the first chapter, he dreams of becoming a cartoon artist in order to get rich and escape the cycles of poverty and abuse on the reservation. The idea that hope exists off the rez is echoed in later chapters, where Junior finds himself caught between home on the reservation and pursuing his dreams in the outside world. Junior asks his parents, \"Who has the most hope?\" to which they answer \"White people\".[h] The rez is characterized by lack of opportunity and poor education, the solution to which appears to lie in the Western world. Hence, the novel explores the theme of hope and dreams through Junior's struggles to find a path to break free of his seemingly doomed fate on the reservation.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1738664322, "similarity": 0.989010989010989, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "582508bffc37715fae391dc2daa4e9290ea1f83f2cd1d85d547c768316c06efe", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "off the rez", "matched_aliases": ["off the rez"], "query_id": "test3448", "question_hash": "ea684651facbea63ceedbaee895b2b7a7e6fa11b8944e77e89a1e4e7dc37b0dc", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "row_hash": "d351c9e586bc4bb3b4da37756b84b5ad298c6ad6b2807737004ba1a051e873cb", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 912924074, "similarity": 0.11756664388243336, "source_content_hash": "6f5bc4cede0188ec2d0f4cfb088bba2894e430f5b531a0643f693f81ac8f42ad", "source_hash": "e78d0fd52754206d374a5b9d0b6e361d1180c5195d1d599356d4d933e8d58ae3", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ac85d539db180ff3ed736ec10d2ffb0e5c6f0188d32811013fa2b3f058c54f7a", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "m