{"doc_id": "doc58686", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Rigor mortis is very important in meat technology. The onset of rigor mortis and its resolution partially determine the tenderness of meat. If the post-slaughter meat is immediately chilled to 15 °C (59 °F), a phenomenon known as cold shortening occurs, whereby the muscle sarcomeres shrink to a third of their original length.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1544858207, "similarity": 0.9938837920489296, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Rigor mortis is a critical factor in meat technology, as its onset and eventual resolution play a partial role in determining the overall tenderness of the product. When post-slaughter meat is rapidly cooled to 15°C (59°F), a phenomenon called cold shortening occurs, causing muscle sarcomeres to contract significantly.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1943136762, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "f2260eba0c8050abacff64df29239c6c9639f9dfa5080b874d50dd2a4c103a3e", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "tenderness of meat", "matched_aliases": ["tenderness of meat"], "query_id": "test1659", "question_hash": "839cfcac3d738b5d217726f42ae83b28b0424725df657dda647a07c2425738e7", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "55ae27270ce08eacdbe8bd2b06ac62a969bb1af42679d88f1ca8057bbe5b163c", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 566292939, "similarity": 0.186219739292365, "source_content_hash": "a339a20cd6035b95114e84f4bd9bf53883e144a42434bceaa2567f6cc2e60055", "source_hash": "6d6ca55e5174233880e997ccd1db6f266375ca1f750c6af2263ed783d76df1a8", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "57d481d257a9dbbf2b9c7e927f3d75be9f0c96e7413bb9fec742c270fbc9335d", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc60835", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Patience is a virtue is a proverbial phrase referring to one of the seven heavenly virtues typically said to date back to \"Psychomachia,\" an epic poem written in the fifth century.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 7866308, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "278bfd2bcf95e9a5301ae4693acd3fc11cf70653c0f2d0d14769472d8657c94b", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "\"Psychomachia,\"", "matched_aliases": ["\"Psychomachia,\""], "query_id": "test1714", "question_hash": "90a9546e47b84cba016ef7c9f65fe8f1469bd26200ec816f27eb763d6204addb", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "3923984b6435248137e47287a40b7b26f08248dc11d5d2f1eff9cf92b3990982", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 521308520, "similarity": 0.416, "source_content_hash": "2decb9a1278f4b5e7cceba42da93a53764407542e93cc1c96218e78a34902071", "source_hash": "d946a7efb1085e9e99a5f8236822d49f7d0e1ecf02ab54e6d9749d25b6137c73", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "fc4a5c4267c501cbf1960ef0d1c60dc4b3bf8b5a5e44e79ae1f89baab7d174af", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc61057", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 1700 Cascadia earthquake occurred along the Cascadia subduction zone on January 26 with an estimated moment magnitude of 8.7–9.2. This megathrust earthquake involved the Juan de Fuca Plate from mid-Vancouver Island, south along the Pacific Northwest coast as far as northern California. The length of the fault rupture was about 1,000 kilometers (620 miles), with an average slip of 20 meters (66 ft).", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 163869191, "similarity": 0.9938195302843016, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "c093f6b43c77de7100118896192018e69e7c4c5f02448020cd677c35474dd410", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "The 1700 Cascadia earthquake", "matched_aliases": ["The 1700 Cascadia earthquake"], "query_id": "test1722", "question_hash": "d77d0a17697b05e2bd3069f12a5ceb8de6b7ccaf25dec4bedfe7a6bb5d2a3ef8", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "7b69e94e8e97936633a9dbcd93ea0132aedd88d4b63cb2f48bfa5dd1ddca27b0", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1494068579, "similarity": 0.637125748502994, "source_content_hash": "3f3cf11204dc3a7e56fef3ad2bec688e083cd591963d5f64e3621fd28913812e", "source_hash": "16c4cb4b3ebaf3a73c7b4f7764f1372f211db12af502d058db625097e98a4310", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "10b50d38ccb98ecda2cc8124365ea3f792d4da3e54950b266156f1febefe745b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
