{"doc_id": "doc70508", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the season ten episode \"Nelson's Sparrow\", Jason Gideon was murdered off-screen, having been shot dead at a close range by a serial killer named Donnie Mallick (Arye Gross), which prompts the BAU team to investigate Gideon's murder. During the flashbacks focusing on a young version of him for the episode which show him working at the BAU in 1978, he is played by Ben Savage.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1852944086, "similarity": 0.9920212765957447, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In the television series Criminal Minds, the character Jason Gideon is revealed to have been murdered in the tenth season's episode titled \"Nelson's Sparrow,\" where he was shot to death by a serial killer named Donnie Mallick.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 894704620, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "ac0a33c98c901bc234807e1f64d575eee58910e0b622825521edd4da6be84406", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "\"Nelson's Sparrow\"", "matched_aliases": ["\"Nelson's Sparrow\""], "query_id": "test2013", "question_hash": "1f52896b020e34aa2258c35966a91f2d625365bb8dd622caa53fde04ddaa7def", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "b060b57476f5db976f79ed7034fddf406ea38ee845db606a6f66bd80511e9bc9", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 579725730, "similarity": 0.760797342192691, "source_content_hash": "904537dd5531eb740d972f569d5aba931ffcde1e5f41decaaee421999745b83e", "source_hash": "7f76c88964b4e9501103f56d20b37a547a6c5eda11cb69df3ebe6219ef51ba56", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a60f17d6bdced0b6ef69e53db109533ae59c99c89817c4a9e768757c388df94e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic",