{"doc_id": "doc100729", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Clearing of the land altered the Delta's ecology, increasing the severity of flooding along the Mississippi. Much land is now held by agribusinesses. A largely rural state with agricultural areas dominated by industrial farms, Mississippi is ranked low or last among the states in such measures as health, educational attainment, and median household income.[6][7][8] The state's catfish aquaculture farms produce the majority of farm-raised catfish consumed in the United States.[9]", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1186641323, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "954da8dae16c21d823af7d6337e1d81dd59f7341579395ab089ddfe25e760bc7", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "farm-raised catfish", "matched_aliases": ["farm-raised catfish"], "query_id": "test2942", "question_hash": "7936577e7e5761e4f441710a74042cef4569efbf7ea3000082fc400feefa754f", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "f698b1bba21b3f8035e0eff592cce19b489d62394b00c0386ea7c0382588a2c6", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2036665914, "similarity": 0.016786570743405275, "source_content_hash": "da8e1208de1a65ac63830ab02907691b23b30ebcf822fe68fe51d8615448b190", "source_hash": "fef7acd21b1e27237249ceef6e0ff0a68f2c6dc474da1782a034943510ea7c17", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a811ba2cb4ea8c0671eb9ebe3f4319cfd3b8000cbb428d30baec63722c15fa60", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc106974", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Indian Ocean is the warmest ocean in the world, with long-term records showing a rapid, continuous warming of about 0.7–1.2°C (1.3–2.2°F) between 1901 and 2012. This phenomenon is the largest among the tropical oceans and occurs roughly three times faster than warming in the Pacific. Research indicates that human-induced greenhouse warming, along with changes in the frequency and magnitude of El Niño events, acts as a trigger for this strong warming in the Indian Ocean.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1526080524, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "82225a4e7f138abedb6f1be426d5087f6c9ae216131bc417f63865671e5346fb", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "human induced greenhouse warming", "matched_aliases": ["human induced greenhouse warming"], "query_id": "test3132", "question_hash": "b109467e40e7eacfea82060c73d79d38146650673eb0339d19ef97e365cbca7e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "3950d08eef5112ad6ebfe86ecc100d5a6691faead7976fd1a81393959f764224", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 64670297, "similarity": 0.2697768762677485, "source_content_hash": "defa0763dd795f2887ca7b90ef705f6b6768d30c2f8cf28e73c47aacfed34b15", "source_hash": "a8da216fc9ab3f05e836b3cb9eabd777c4725b35a0b82e4555da4b7263f9cfea", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "0e13264ca186486846fe61ce6cbe44f7197dcf22fafdbf963c0fb4c1f2614640", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc110422", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Planned to open in 2020, the stadium will serve as the home to the Los Angeles Rams and Los Angeles Chargers of the National Football League (NFL). It is also scheduled to host Super Bowl LVI in February 2022 and the College Football Playoff National Championship in January 2023. During the 2028 Summer Olympics, the stadium is expected to host the opening ceremony and soccer. Archery will be held on the grounds outside the stadium.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 100521451, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "333868784eab61cd9c37c90907c4239d6dfa02a0ee0dd257c3614a9b4f02d3c2", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "2020", "matched_aliases": ["2020"], "query_id": "test3225", "question_hash": "eb042ee658e0ded23c0b3fbf3dab73b5ff8fe2c5d1e3dfec16090b1c8a30f2b0", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "59c96a8a1ab038e1959eb61d90927d16c6109b79e8c6c9e811972080fccf67eb", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 650653957, "similarity": 0.7483731019522777, "source_content_hash": "f2aff31e2260d02e288f09a9071d8de16010a4821e4a57cbec3e9b0ba93201de", "source_hash": "2d9ecc279b9f2220de0d35d8c23ebc392fe4dd2621e4f863b3ffefb468167d89", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "003e85c4ba469e011a78d123d04dab5d513744c8f83ee2f9f73c3de373623040", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc114519", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The sciatic nerve (/saɪˈætɪk/; also called ischiadic nerve, ischiatic nerve, \"butt nerve\") is a large nerve in humans and other animals. It begins in the lower back and runs through the buttock and down the lower limb. It is the longest and widest single nerve in the human body, going from the top of the leg to the foot on the posterior aspect.[1] The sciatic nerve provides the connection to the nervous system for nearly the whole of the skin of the leg, the muscles of the back of the thigh, and those of the leg and foot. It is derived from spinal nerves L4 to S3. It contains fibers from both the anterior and posterior divisions of the lumbosacral plexus.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 79971387, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "476a333807135d95f08d33ad8f8398f478f047ae443042d079b4c401f387eeeb", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "on the posterior aspect", "matched_aliases": ["on the posterior aspect"], "query_id": "test3356", "question_hash": "f7b0db7e689217e5636cdc1c3527d355ab5c5733a76dd8e3826a171ddfebbe34", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "b0a0a014543ab05fb176d045011b6b78e3628f9b854f5b6600d3a7171cbe34c2", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1725618221, "similarity": 0.2465753424657534, "source_content_hash": "a4a209f572533232007aae39f6cea1cb280d43fc8cd01f414f7311ce21419e27", "source_hash": "d1fef1cdc30016d1985b6d9e7ebc4268308a41c8dfcaa2c37d661f697b9203ae", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "b3005b81a11cb558983db0f2646d9540f88b54a81392eb12e32fd0283a7e13c1", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc115425", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Electronic Fund Transfer Act was passed by the U.S. Congress in 1978 and signed by President Jimmy Carter, to establish the rights and liabilities of consumers as well as the responsibilities of all participants in electronic funds transfer activities.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 236224066, "similarity": 0.9941747572815534, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "e500c5129b66ee7208d5320380d933538dad0ac07e5ab493d04bf59a6ac7a6a4", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "in 1978", "matched_aliases": ["in 1978", "1978"], "query_id": "test3381", "question_hash": "b6e2176862a01cff9dbeab21656e4184df59380ab9a83a26576aed655a13745f", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "242310eea40394648f06d7642a1ef59e9b18ad171101db4781a469daed89258f", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 306028642, "similarity": 0.162748643761302, "source_content_hash": "15c47660f9e876b5dee2a03955c74f21a04c8e187341cbce607391ad326c256c", "source_hash": "8373b889724e424b5abcb0d71223595140fedfdd5c2e37e77fe5560530754008", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "333af92d3b2c381fd0bff013631a6413db4e134d41adb1eee88f6eb8a184715b", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc117531", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "On 23 August 2015, the BBC announced that the Met Office will lose its contract as the BBC is legally obliged to ensure that licence fee payers get the best value for money. MeteoGroup is due to take over on 31 March 2018, although the on air presenting team is not expected to change, and Met Office severe weather warnings will continue to be used by BBC Weather.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1686108532, "similarity": 0.9878213802435724, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "On 23 August 2015, the BBC announced that the Met Office will lose its contract as the BBC is legally obliged to ensure that licence fee payers get the best value for money. MeteoGroup is due to take over on 31 March 2018, although the on air presenting team is not expected to change, and Met Office severe weather warnings will continue to be used by BBC Weather.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1065644966, "similarity": 0.9878213802435724, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "ae9bbc0899e45a604287c83bc523b9dd1635c072454c1f112e48a91e3d4794ff", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "31 March 2018", "matched_aliases": ["31 March 2018"], "query_id": "test3447", "question_hash": "0fdf602c1f6d0d1c35f14052102bf01ce7e9f1ed702cc017caf78e5dc913020c", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "f9e2c951dd6af9add366d4be0ee4014cd00c0b61e2d89a1eedacd50eaa8ad3b6", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 709790318, "similarity": 0.36803874092009686, "source_content_hash": "2f4faa73aac48b4fa0d0a177bacd746c1a39d4bd90a7b4e6b2dc92b926eec3ca", "source_hash": "cfe695e7d8edfe2556b5f21b6b5443b64531f50108f18f9ac4a637cce615b12e", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "de472c0ae67cdef226b323932974f451e75e5d33ab66651a19cbad