{"doc_id": "doc3123", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the small working class town of Clairton, Pennsylvania, in late 1967, steel workers Mike Vronsky, Steven Pushkov, and Nick Chevotarevich, with the support of their friends and co-workers Stan and Peter \"Axel\" Axelrod and local bar owner and friend John Welsh, prepare for two rites of passage: marriage and military service. Mike is a serious but unassuming leader; Steven the groom-to-be, pecked-at by his mother; and Nick the introspective man who loves deer hunting.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1378396388, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In the small working class town of Clairton, Pennsylvania, in late 1967, steel workers Mike Vronsky, Steven Pushkov, and Nick Chevotarevich, with the support of their friends and co-workers Stan and Peter \"Axel\" Axelrod and local bar owner and friend John Welsh, prepare for two rites of passage: marriage and military service. Mike is a serious but unassuming leader; Steven the groom-to-be, pecked-at by his mother; and Nick the introspective man who loves deer hunting.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 156795360, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "b6f9179a03e96031eaed4d27ca134959a2f59c0ce8330a1ca0994804e3f6bebc", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "late 1967", "matched_aliases": ["late 1967", "1967"], "query_id": "test98", "question_hash": "f34ae196c0094a97c4d6aa840099ecd3dd7e4255d8fc202bff4e2af981305690", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 2, "row_hash": "3ec6cc91e62e88e26a26cd4407d919810acc02710de8f9d36a94304853634b18", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1110201520, "similarity": 0.25054945054945055, "source_content_hash": "4224f542e152122fe007a94e542eb51173cba8f3a9450fe942ae7bf5ddd40cc8", "source_hash": "93460f26019fba271ada21546487e93cfd6474368655e6