{"doc_id": "doc96527", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Typically, no license or advanced training beyond just firearm familiarization (for rentals) and range rules familiarization is usually required for using a shooting range in the United States; the only common requirement is that the shooter must be at least 18 or 21 years old (or have a legal guardian present), and must sign a waiver prior to shooting.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1738824114, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "While a license is usually not needed to enter a shooting range in the United States, specific age restrictions and waivers remain mandatory. Generally, the only common requirement is that the shooter must be at least 18 or 21 years old, or have a legal guardian present, and must sign a waiver prior to shooting.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1217038369, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "7277118f148eede36e93be528e36724eb22f8ca5aeead372e8791588fef4ed48", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Typically, no", "matched_aliases": ["Typically, no"], "query_id": "test2810", "question_hash": "78ce55060d568f4b62f8fd7234478f260bd3fe81fdaf638b469568b406639f13", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 2, "row_hash": "73171f619857c7f106643c73b9bdfff5fba31c4c3a0c5f6909d8d379e9bab347", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 378915187, "similarity": 0.9491978609625669, "source_content_hash": "c0075928779016ca88eccf7a10b3913bdac29cae04bc24c8a5085eea628b50e7", "source_hash": "e32937a6fba9331c896f89588ef81dd9747e0a6dc8325beede84e97bd94a0184", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6d92a748a4ac2bc64c134b18027df43274f2e2661b78234d1ee47a2d0e9b8b34", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate":